 improve the efficacy of the tonic. Please use only good quality essential oils, and do not use any artificial or mineral oil to mix. How-To-Use: To maintain or get a bouquet of healthy hair on your head, use a hair tonic after every wash. Try to blow dry hair before use of Hair Tonic. This is because water will dilute the tonic or prevent it from penetrating your scalp. The heat from the hairdryer will also open up the pores so they can better absorb the tonic. Apply hair tonic only on the crown area as it will flow down to other areas naturally. Then massage the tonic into the scalp with your fingertips. There is no need to rinse it off. Is-This-For-Me: Do you have dry or frizzy hair? OR Are you looking for smooth styling of your hair after hair wash, without strong hold? OR Are you facing localised baldness or Hairloss? OR Are you feel your hair are thinning with age? OR If you have ticked YES as an answer to any of above questions, then it is time for you to order Briganantadi Hair Tonic Hair Serum Spray. Media-Reviews: A happy blogger https://prettylittlethings.winkl.co/content/blue-nectar-9969ef a. Weight: 100.0000. Short Description: Blue Nectar Brignanantadi Hair Tonic is a light hair serum which works as a hair tonic spray for smooth styling of hair without a strong hold. Enriched with vital active powerful herbs like Bhringraj, Mulethi, Brahmi, Almond Oil, Coconut Oil, Rosemary and Aloe Vera it is a hair serum spray for men and women both, with a light hibiscus fragrance keeping your hair fresh for entire day. Reviews: Customer Reviews Based on 12 reviews Write a review. Hsn: 300490. Ingredients Content1: Rosemary - Redensyl Alternate Rosemary has anti-inflammatory properties that promote nerve growth & improve circulation. Benefit Content 3: Non-Sticky Nourishment Almond for non-sticky nourishment penetrates the scalp and nourishes it to make follicles strong. Benefit Content 2: Reduces Dandruff & itchiness Ayurvedic herbs in this tonic help to reduce hai