itle: Know your Product. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Product Footer Description: Nabhi Oil with Ghee & Almond Oil for Skin Glow, Improved Digestion & Healthy Joints Many traditional wellness procedures revolve around basic activities carried out regularly for the benefit of one’s body. An example of a basic activity that is practised in Ayurvedic medicine is nabhi chikitsa, which translates to 'navel oiling'. This involves applying a drop of herbal oil into the navel at night. Considered the centre of nourishment in traditional healing, the navel is believed to play an important role in distributing the benefits of oils through the body. This is why many people today are rediscovering the nabhi oil benefits associated with this ancient ritual. Starting from keeping skin supple, all the way to ensuring internal comfort and relaxation. The Blue Nectar Nabhi Oil with Ghee & Almond Oil uses a combination of 22 herbs along with natural sources such as A2 cow ghee, almond oil, and sesame oil. The blend is formulated especially for use before going to bed at night and ensures that all three benefits are attained simultaneously. Understanding Nabhi Oil Benefits The holistic approach to skincare is based on cleansing, treating, nourishing, and protecting the skin. Every step has its own purpose for maintaining the balance of the skin and enhancing its condition. Cleansing for a Clean Base Navel oiling has long been practised in Ayurveda as a gentle yet effective ritual to support internal balance. Since the navel area is traditionally considered a central point connected to multiple channels in the body, applying herbal oils here is believed to help distribute nourishment more effectively. The common advantages associated with nabhi oil are: - It ensures smooth skin and a radiant glow - It helps digest food - Nourishing properties ensure joints work well - It promotes relaxation before sleeping Unlike complicated techniques of sustaining one’s well-being, nabhi oil therapy can be attained through simply using a few drops daily. Why Use Nabhi Oil Daily? Most of the time, skin care involves superficial skincare practices or even body care practices that do not touch upon the inner aspects of the person’s wellness. In contrast, nabhi oiling is a practice that integrates the two aspects by incorporating massage as well as the benefits of using herbal oils. By regularly practising nabhi oil application, an individual creates regularity in the practice that will slowly but surely help his/her body get accustomed to the treatment. Since it is applied before sleeping, the benefits of the treatment become more pronounced because of the prolonged interaction of the oil with the body tissues. What Makes Blue Nectar Nabhi Oil Unique? The Nabhi Oil by Blue Nectar is formulated based on the Ayurvedic approach of nourishing oneself in a simpler yet continuous manner. Rather than relying on one base oil alone, the product utilizes several enriching oils along with 22 different herbs. Its lightweight consistency makes application easy, while the herb-infused formulation supports multiple benefits beyond surface-level moisturisation. The product is suitable for nightly use and can be seamlessly added to any bedtime routine without requiring extensive preparation. By focusing on traditional ingredients that are known for nourishment and comfort, this nabhi oil offers a practical way to experience the long-cherished nabhi oil benefits in a modern lifestyle. Key Ingredients & Their Benefits A2 Cow Ghee A2 cow ghee has been used for centuries in Ayurvedic treatments due to its extremely nutritious quality. The ingredient aids in bringing richness to the blend while providing overall comfort to the body through the ancient nabhi technique. Additionally, the conditioning aspect of the ghee assists in retaining skin softness and elasticity. Almond Oil This nourishing oil is known for its nutrient-rich and moisturising properties. In the Nabhi Care Oil, almond oil aids in promoting skin glow with its light and nutritious properties. Moreover, this ingredient adds a soothing aspect to the product, thus making the nightly routine relaxing and rejuvenating. Sesame Oil Being one of the most used base oils in Ayurveda, sesame oil boasts warming and penetrating characteristics. This ingredient helps deliver all herbs and assists in the body’s joint comfort. Therefore, adding sesame oil makes this oil highly therapeutic. How to Use Nabhi Oil 1. Lie down comfortably before sleeping. 2. Pour 2-3 drops of nabhi oil into your navel. 3. Gently rub around the navel in a circular motion. 4. Do this before sleeping every night for thorough absorption. 5. Repeat every day for better benefits. This simple nightly ritual takes only a minute but can become a grounding part of long-term wellness care. Who Can Use This Nabhi Oil? - Those looking to explore traditional nabhi oil benefits - Individuals seeking a simple Ayurvedic bedtime ritual - People wanting support for skin softness and glow - Those looking to include digestive and joint co. Ayurvedic Description: What's Unique: Contains A2 Cow Ghee & Almond Oil Plant-Based Herbs: Almond Oil and Turmeric Use for: Improved Digestion & Healthy Joints. Benefit Content: Digestive Comfort Nabhi oil supports gut health by stimulating the navel, promoting digestion, reducing bloating, and enhancing nutrient absorption for overall digestive well-being. Benefit Content 2: Joint Flexibility Helps lubricate joints, easing stiffness and discomfort. Regular application around the navel enhances circulation, reducing inflammation and promoting smoother movement. Benefit Content 3: Nourish Body Deeply hydrates and revitalizes skin, supporting cell regeneration. Ayurvedic oils nourish from within, improving overall vitality, skin texture, and body balance. Blue Heading 2: High Herb Quotient. Faq Content1: Ayurvedic Nabhi Oil is a blend of plant-based herbs like almond oil, til oil, haldi, and more, formulated for belly button application. It nourishes the skin, strengthens hair, and supports digestion. Faq Content2: The belly button is a vital absorption point in Ayurveda. Massaging almond oil on the belly button gives glowing skin, supports gut health, and improves circulation. Faq Content3: For best results, apply a few drops every night before bed. Massage gently in and around the navel for better absorption. Faq Content4: Yes, but it is traditionally recommended at night for better absorption and effectiveness. Faq Content5: Yes, it is made with natural Ayurvedic ingredients and is generally safe. However, do a patch test if you have sensitive skin. Faq Content6: This is a 100% Ayurvedic preparation and tested to be Safe. Free from harmful chemicals like Sulphates, parabens, etc. Faq Question1: What is Ayurvedic Nabhi Oil?. Faq Question2: How does applying Almond Oil to the belly button help?. Faq Question3: How often should I use Nabhi Oil?. Faq Question4: Can I apply Nabhi Oil in the morning?. Faq Question5: Is this Ayurvedic nabhi oil safe for all skin types?. Faq Question5: Is this Nabhi Oil safe to use?. Ingredients Content1: A2 Cow Ghee Ghee is rich in vitamins A, D, E, and. It nourishes the skin, promotes digestion, and supports joint health. Ingredients Content2: Almond Oil Almond oil contains vitamin E and essential fatty acids. It hydrates skin, improves complexion, and aids in digestive balance. Ingredients Content3: Til Oil Also known as sesame oil, it has vitamins and essential fatty acids that provide deep nourishment to the skin, improve elasticity, and support overall skin health. Complete Ingredients Heading: Complete Ingredients List. Complete Ingredients: Ingredient Scientific Name Benefits Go Ghrit (Cow Ghee) Butyris Lac (Cow Ghee) Moisturizes and nourishes the skin. Badam Oil (Almond Oil) Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil Nourishes and softens skin. Nagarmotha Cyperus Rotundus Root Extract Balancing and soothing properties. Anantmool Hemidesmus Indicus Root Extract Skin-purifying and soothing benefits. Manjist Rubia Cordifolia Root Extract Helps improve skin tone appearance. Malkangani Celastrus Paniculatus Seed Oil Scalp and hair nourishment. Haldi (Turmeric) Curcuma Longa Root Extract Provides antioxidant protection. Gokhru Tribulus Terrestris Fruit Extract Supports skin vitality. Bel Aegle Marmelos Fruit Extract Soothing and balancing skin. Khas Vetiveria Zizanioides Root Extract Provides cooling, refreshing, and calming effects on skin. Arni Clerodendrum Phlomidis Extract Skin-soothing properties. Lotus Nelumbo Nucifera Flower Extract Helps hydrate and maintain skin radiance. Jal Chulai Amaranthus Spinosus Extract Maintains skin health. Champa Michelia Champaca Flower Extract Adds natural fragrance and is known for its soothing effect. Til Oil (Sesame Oil) Sesamum Indicum (Sesame) Seed Oil Nourishes, conditions, and helps maintain skin hydration. Wheatgerm Oil Triticum Vulgare (Wheat Germ) Oil Helps soften and protect skin. Olive Oil Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil Moisturizes and protects against dryness. Jojoba Oil Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil Balances and nourishes skin. Mulethi (Licorice) Glycyrrhiza Glabra Root Extract Helps improve skin appearance.","price":"690.00","link":"https://www.bluenectar.co.in/products/nabhi-belly-button-oil-almond-oil-skin-glow?variant=47047134707957","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_12788de7-bd99-462b-86cf-c15ef5c3bae3-optimized.webp?v=1775631322","variants":[{"variant_id":47047134707957,"title":"30ml","option1":"30ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"WONAN030UD","taxable":true,"available":true,"price":"690.00","compare_at_price":"795.00","position":1,"product_id":9032388346101,"created_at":"2025-09-17T09:11:59.000Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T18:02:56.000Z","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_12788de7-bd99-462b-86cf-c15ef5c3bae3-optimized.webp?v=1775631322","id":47047