{"type":"response","data":{"products":[{"handle":"tea-tree-oil-ayurvedic-hair-oil-healthy-scalp-anti-dandruff","product_id":6197456011436,"title":"Briganantadi Tea Tree Anti Dandruff Oil for Hair | Clean & Healthy Scalp","description":"Briganantadi Anti-Dandruff Tea Tree Oil is formulated with 12 ayurvedic hair nourishing herbs like Tea Tree, Neem Oil, Bhringraj, etc. Microbial and anti bacterial properties of Tea tree and neem oil helps to fight dandruff, itchy scalp, and flakiness. For the best results, apply this anti-dandruff oil at least twice a week.åÊ Rated 4.8/5 (26 reviews). Use Product: The Ayurveda Lab ™- Tea Tree — Tea tree oil was first produced from Melaleuca alternifolia in Australia. Tea tree oil (Melaleuca alternifolia) is known in Ayurveda as Krimighna (antimicrobial) and Shothaghna (anti-inflammatory). It has traditionally been used externally as a paste or oil to cure skin infections, wounds, acne, and dandruff, as well as to balance the Kapha and Pitta Doshas and promote healthy, clear skin. Why Blue: Science Backed Benefits — Findings In this study, 126 people with mild to moderate dandruff received a 5% tea tree oil shampoo or a placebo every day for four weeks. The study discovered that the tea tree oil group had a 41% improvement in dandruff severity compared to 11% in the placebo group, with significant decreases in itching and greasiness and no reported side effects, indicating that tea tree oil is both effective and well-tolerated. Journal of American Academy of Dermatology(Dec, 2002). Blue: Ingredients Transparency — All Herbs declared on products in form of Herb Quotient; With more than 150 quality herbs, our products have High Herb Quotient; Free From Harmful Chemicals — All our products are free from harmful chemicals & mineral oils. Custom Tab Title: Soothes Itchy & Flaky Scalp | Prevents Dandruff. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Description Title: Know your Product. Faqs: Q.1 Does it contain any mineral oil? No, it does not contain any mineral oil. It is completely natural and does not contain any artificial chemicals or preservatives. Q.2 Does it reduce hairfall? Blue Nectar Tea Tree Anti Danruff Oil is fortified with active ayurvedic herbs like Tea Tree, Bhringraj, Amla, Neem that are known to effectively reduce dandruff by addressing the root cause of Dandruff. While some of these ingredients are known to promote hair growth as well, you may also check out Blue Nectar Briganantadi Hair Fall control & Healthy Scalp Oil that is further rich in herbs known to be effective in controlling hair fall. Q.3 Does it remove oily dandruff? Yes absolutely. With regular use you should see significant visible difference in two weeks. Apply the oil on your scalp overnight and use a very mild herbal shampoo to wash off the oil in the morning. Leave shampoo on your scalp for few minutes for it to work with Blue Nectar Tea Tree Anti Dandruff Oil, before you finally rinse off shampoo and oil with water. Follow this routine daily for 2 weeks to see the difference. Herbs-Quotient: Blue Nectar Ayurvedic Tea Tree Anti Dandruff & Healthy Scalp Oil has goodness of 14 Ayurvedic Herbs like Tea Tree, Rosemary, Bhringraj, Amla, Manjistha, Coconut Oil, Sesamme Oil, Rosemary Oil, Lavandar Oil, Almond Oil, Bawchi, Neem Oil, Gudhal, and Anantmool. How-To-Use: Massage the anti dandruff oil into scalp using finger tips for 10 minutes, leave it for overnight, cleanse your hair with Ayurvedic anti dandruff shampoo. Repeat at least twice a week, for better results go for thrice a week. Is-This-For-Me: For Dry & Infected scalp: Blue Nectar Anti Dandruff Hair Oil has potent qualities of its herbs. These herbs are carefully blended with classical ayurvedic principles and may help to heal dry and infected scalp. For Dandfull control: Herbs like Tea Tree, Rosemary and Neem may prevent growth of yeast that helps to fight dandruff. For Hair Fall Control: Ros