{"type":"response","data":{"products":[{"handle":"pain-relief-oil-back-pain-body-oil-joint-pain-relief-oil","product_id":6197464203436,"title":"Cinnamon Pain Relief Oil for Back & Joint (17 Herbs)","description":"Devtvakadi Ayurvedic Pain Relief Oil with Cinnamon and Clove has 17 Ayurvedic Herbs which help to provide natural relief in Back Pain, Joint Pain, and pain in neck, legs and knee. Cinnamon and Clove are known in Ayurveda for their anti-inflammatory properties that help the body to fight pain, naturally. Other active herbs like Mahamash Tailam, Mahanarayanam Tailam, Dashmool and Jatamasi in Devtvakadi pain relief oil relieves muscle pain and soothes muscle soreness, making it the most effective pain relief oil. This natural herbal pain oil is free from mineral oil or preservatives and could be used for men, women and pregnant women. Rated 4.93/5 (678 reviews). Use Product: The Ayurveda Lab ™-Devatvakadi Oil — Devatvakadi, a classic Ayurvedic formulation known for its potent anti-inflammatory and anti-microbial qualities, is derived from the Sanskrit words Devatvaka (cinnamon bark) and Adi (and others). By lowering toxins and balancing doshas, it is used in decoctions and oils to treat joint pain, inflammation, respiratory conditions, and digestive disorders. Why Blue: Science Backed Benefits — Findings: 48 people with aching muscles participated in the trial and were given exercises, oil-free massages, or massages with clove oil over the course of six days. Muscle strength significantly improved in those who had massages with clove oil (ρ = 0.000). Malahayati International Journal of Nursing and Health Science(August 2024). Blue: Ingredients Transparency — All Herbs declared on products in form of Herb Quotient; With more than 150 quality herbs, our products have High Herb Quotient; Free From Harmful Chemicals — All our products are free from harmful chemicals & mineral oils. Product Footer Description: Why Do You Get Joint Pain? When you reach old age, joint pain can be your worst nightmare or an unwanted guest. There are several joints of the body where joint pain can be felt. It is a common discomfort felt in the hand, feet, hips, knees, or spine. Sometimes it can be constant, and at other times it can come and go. People may experience joint pain that affects their ability to do basic tasks as well as affects the function of their joints. Joint pain occurs when cartilage, the protective cushion between bones, wears away, causing the joint to stiffen and become painful. Joint pain and swelling also can occur because of chronic diseases. Knee pain is the most common complaint by senior citizens, followed by shoulder pain and hip pain. Joint pain can affect other parts of the body too - ankles, feet, shoulders and hands. Choose the Best Pain Relief Oil for Joint Pain Joint pain has become common in young adults too and the reasons could be many. Overwork is one of them. Working continuously for 8-9 hours leads to serious joint pain that will be a serious problem in the future. Joint pain can sometimes require medical intervention. However, most of the time joint pain can be effectively managed at home by using home remedies. Some of the popular home remedies include pain oil, oil for pain relief and body massage oil. But is it worth using pain relief oil? And how to choose the best pain relief oil for effective management of joint pain? There are plethora of pain relieving oils available in the market. It is difficult to select an ayurvedic, natural pain oil which provides relief from back pain, shoulder pain and joint pain. It is very imperative to choose a pain oil that not only relieves pain naturally but is also effective for your skin type. One must read the labels of their pain oil carefully and choose the best pain oil which has natural ingredients and is free from harmful chemicals. Oil Massage Benefits with Ayurvedic Pain Relief Oil Massaging with an ayurvedic pain oil is a natural healing process that has been used for thousands of years to treat various types of pain. Ayurvedic oil for pain relief is made from different natural herbs and provides relief from different types of pain. These types of body massage oils have been gaining in popularity because they provide pain relief without prescription medications. Relief from Pain: Pain relief oil massage soothes your entire body. Pain Oil is particularly beneficial for joints, knees, and strained muscles that require special care. Relaxing the joints and restoring damaged tissues and muscles is one of their therapeutic effects. Massaging with body oil, which has pain relieving properties, can reduce friction between sore joints thereby reducing pain and enhancing flexibility. Strengthen Muscles & Joints: Regular massage with pain oil helps to strengthen weak muscles. Ayurvedic pain relief oil made with natural herbs without harsh chemicals is helpful in reducing muscular stiffness, sprains and pain. Increased Blood Circulation: Joints and muscles become sore with poor blood circulation in cold weather and a sedentary lifestyle. Painkiller oil results in an increase in joint fluid production. The pain oil helps to remove toxins from muscles by performing a deep tissue massage, especially on the joints. The gentle strokes of a soothing massage oil increase blood circulation and stimulate joint fluid secretion. Quickly Relieves Muscle Tension: The Ayurvedic oil for pain relief by Blue Nectar is formulated with the perfect blend of essential oils and carrier oils to soothe strained muscles and aching joints. Massaging with light strokes allows the pain oil to penetrate deeper into the skin and gets easily absorbed into the muscles. It reduces muscle tensions that cause painful spasms and irritating contractions. This also reduces muscle inflammation and acts as a body tranquilizer. Stimulates mood: Body oil has a soothing effect on the muscles and joints, as well as the mind. It has a soothing effect on the mind as well as the body, targeting joint pains, knee pains, and aching muscles. You'll feel an immediate boost in your mood after a good body massage with pain oil. Not just physical health but mental health will be improved too. How does pain relief oil by Blue Nectar help Blue Nectar Pain Relief Oil with 17 natural herbs is prepared from 100% herbal and pure pain-healing ingredients like Cinnamon, Clove, Ashwagandha, Shatavari, Dhanwantaram Tailam etc. According to Ayurveda, cinnamon and clove have properties that help the body fight pain naturally. This pain oil contains potent herbal ingredients that can help with arthritis, body pain, knee pain, joint pain, etc. Pain relief oil by Blue Nectar eases tension in the muscles and provides natural relief from back, joint, leg, and knee pain. It is non-greasy and contains no mineral oil, sulfates, parabens or chemicals. All ingredients in this body oil are clearly listed on the package. What is th. Custom Tab Title: Healthy & Strong Joints | Eases Muscle Pain. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Description Title: Know your Product. Herbs-Quotient: Mahavisgarbh Tailam, Mahanarayan tailam, Dhanwantram tailam, Mahamash tailam, Clove Oil, Cinnamon Oil. How-To-Use: Use 5-10 ml of lukewarm oil and massage affected area. Cover with a cloth to keep it warm. Short Description: Devpushp' means clove and 'Tvak' means Cinnamon. Cinnamon and Clove herbs are known in Ayurveda to have properties that help body fight pain naturally. Devtvakadi is indigineously developed Pain relief oil which has 17 Ayurvedic Herbs that may help to provide natural relief in Back Pain, Joint Pain and Pain in legs and knee. Reviews: Customer Reviews Based on 71 reviews Write a review. Hsn: 300490. Ingredients Content1: Cinnamon Oil Cinnamon oil has been used for thousands of years in Ayurvedic medicine to soothe aching joints & numb pain. Benefit Content 3: Increased Blood Flow Massage with Pain Relief Oil could provide heat to stiff muscles, increase blood circulation and help muscles to relax. Benefit Content 2: Strengthen Muscles & Joints RRegular massage with this pain oil helps to strengthen weak muscles. This helps to reduce muscular stiffness, sprain and pain. Benefit Content: Fights Joint Pain Massage with this pain oil helps to release tension from the muscles and also provide natural relief from Back, Joint, Legs & Knee pain.. Ayurvedic Description: Key Herbs: Cinnamon & Clove Use for: Joint & Muscles Pain Suitable For: All ages including expecting women. Blue Heading 2: High Herb Quotient. Faq Content3: Omega-3 fatty acids, turmeric, ginger, and adequate hydration aid to keep joints naturally lubricated and minimize stiffness. Gentle exercise improves joint fluid circulation. Faq Content6: The product has a shelf life of 3 years from the date of manufacturing. Please refer to the packaging for the exact expiry date. Faq Question5: What is the shelf life of this product?. Faq Content5: Yes, Blue Nectar Pain Oil should provide natural relief when used regularly. Gently massage lukewarm oil over the affected body part. Faq Question5: Can this pain oil be used for elderly people for Knee and Joint Pain?. Faq Content4: Yes, modest walking stimulates blood flow, strengthens muscles, and relieves stiffness, making it a safe and effective treatment for mild back discomfort. Faq Question4: Is walking helpful for back pain?. Faq Question3: How can you naturally lubricate your joints?. Faq Content2: Vitamin D and C are necessary for joint and muscle function. Vitamin D promotes bone health, while Vitamin C aids in collagen synthesis, which reduces joint discomfort. Faq Question2: What is the best vitamin for relieving muscular and joint pain?. Faq Content1: Yes, as it has the combination of Deodaru and Ashwagandha relaxes tense muscles and reduces cramp intensity. Faq Question1: Is the oil beneficial in treating abrupt muscle cramps?. Ingredients Conten