 oil relieves stress and gives a feeling of happiness. Triphaladi fat-burning oil also reduces the cortisol level, which is responsible for stress, thereby helping to destress. How Does Slimming Oil by Blue Nectar Help Slimming Oil by Blue Nectar is a natural fat-burning oil that helps fight excess cellulite from thighs, butts, belly and abdomen with regular body massage. The body oil is fortified with 11 skin-rejuvenating herbs like Sesame Oil, Tea Tree Oil and Flaxseed oil etc. This moisturizing body oil works ideally as a slimming oil and for a relaxing body. It is infused with the goodness of Turmeric Oil and Indian Gooseberry. This massage oil helps improve the overall appearance of the skin by fighting against pigmentation marks and dark spots. Key Ingredients Triphala: A trinity of Ayurvedic herbs, known since ancient times for their efficacy as anti-cellulite herbs. Triphala influences digestion and helps achieve the correct balance of the digestive tract. It takes us o. Custom Tab Title: Body Massage Oil | Body Toning | Skin Hydration. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Description Title: Know your Product. Faqs: Q.1 How to use this oil and when? Warm the oil in a pan or a metal container and massage on your body with tight hands. Cover your body with hot towel after oil application. Steam helps in better absorption of nutrients. You can apply the oil either in the morning half an hour before your bath, or in the night before going to bed, as per your convenience. Leave oil on your body for at least 30 mins, before washing off.Be careful not to use too hot oil. Always check the temperature of oil by dipping your elbow or back of your finger in oil. Q.2 How to warm it? You can heat it in a metallic bowl or pan on low flame on gas burner. Or you can heat it in microwave as well. Ensure that you the oil should be lukewarm at the time of application. Check the temperature of oil with back of your hand before applying on body. Q.3 Can we use it for postpartum belly loss? And if yes then after how much time we can use it? Yes, Blue Nectar Triphaladi anti cellulite oil can be safely used for postpartum skin toning. You can start using it 1 week after delivery in case of normal delivery, and 3-4 weeks in case of C-Section. Q.4 If I don't workout and put this oil will it work to reduce fat from my body? We wish we could say yes. But this oil is not a miracle. It helps you to get rid of excess fat and cellulite in your body and get back into shape only if you control your diet and do some physical activity. It may not be very helpful in case of a passive lifestyle. Q.5 Does this oil help to reduce breast fat? Regular use of Blue Nectar Anti Cellulite Oil helps to fight off excess fat in various parts of body. Do not apply on nipples. Use lukewarm oil to massage with tight hands, followed by steam or hot towel press. Regular daily use for 8-19 weeks should lead to positive results. Q.6 Can this product be used by all age groups? Yes, this is a completely natural prdocut with no artificial chemicals or preservatives. It can be safely used for all age groups.In very few cases people may be allergic to even natural ingredients. It is always recommended to do a patch test by applying oil on inner elbow and leave it for a while. Discontinue the use in case of any adverse impact. Q.7 Can i apply this oil before morning walk. Yes, definitely! A physically active lifestyle and healthy diet will lead to better and sustainable results. Q.8 In how many days we can expect visible results? With daily use on regular basis, you should see visible results in 8-10 weeks. Active physical activity and simple healthy diet ( 3 Nos - No Fried, No Sweet and No Refined Carbohydrates) will help to speed up the process. Q.9 Is this oil suitable for unmarried people's? It is absolutely suitable for unmarried as well as married persons. Blue Nectar products are completely natural and contain active vital herbs. You can use our products confidently. Q.10 How long does one have to cover massage area with hot towel? It is recommended to massage the body with lukewarm oil for at least 10-15 minutes with tight hands. Cover the massaged area with hot towel for another 10-15 minutes. Leave the oil on your body for at least 30-45 minutes for nutrients to be absorbed in your body. Herbs-Quotient: 11 is considered to be auspicious in ancient Indian traditions and 11 is the herbal quotient of Triphaladi anti cellulite and slimming oil. Harad, Baheda & Amla - These three herbs form powerful trinity of herbs called Triphala, well known in ancient ayurveda for it's anti-cellulite and slimming properties. Turmeric is a powerful detox agent, that cleanses skin. Triphala, along with tea tree oil activates enzymes that work to break down excess cellulite. Sendha Namak when massaged on body stimulates body cells, improves blood flow. Flaxseed Oil works wonders for lubricating the body muscles, making the overall combination highly effetive. How-To-Use: Bring the slimming oil to a lukewarm temperature. Check the temperature using back of your hand. Massage on your body parts with tight hands for 10-15 minutes. After that take steam or apply hot towel. Leave the oil on your body for at least 30-45 minutes for the nutrients to be absorbed well in your body. The heat absorption by body helps in fat burn as well as weight loss. Blue Nectar Triphaladi anti cellulite oil is completely natural and safe for external use. Is-This-For-Me: This is a completely natural anti cellulite and slimming oil that helps improve the appearance of skin by toning your body. Through regular use you will experience slimmer silhouette and tighter body contours. If you are aiming for visible improvement in appearance of your skin and body silhouette you must try this oil. In most cases visible improvements are reported within 8-10 weeks of regular use. If you are looking for a companion on your journey to weight loss, this oil will definitely keep you good company. As you work on your physical exercise and nutrition, Triphaladi slimming oil will further accentuate your efforts through effective body toning. Short Description: Completely natural, this ayurvedic slimming oil derives its effectiveness from nutrients of Triphala - Amla, Harad and Baheda - trinity of ayurvedic herbs, known since ancients times for their efficacy as slimming herbs. Simple to use, this anti cellulite oil gives a fresh and youthful feel to body skin of women as well as men alike. Reviews: Customer Reviews Based on 70 reviews Write a review. Hsn: 300490. Ingredients Content1: Triphala – Trinity of Herbs Triphala – Amla, Harad & Baheda – a trinity of Ayurvedic herbs, are known for their efficacy as anti-cellulite herbs. Benefit Content 2: Improves Skin Firmness and Tone Regular massage with this Ayurvedic oil helps improve skin elasticity and firmness, giving a more toned appearance over time. Benefit Content: Reduces The Appearance of Cellulite 11 potent Ayurvedic herbs work to smooth uneven skin texture and reduce the visible appearance of cellulite. Ayurvedic Description: Plant-Based Herbs: Triphala and Tea Tree Oil Use for: Skin Firming & Body Toning Suitable For: All Skin Types. Blue Heading 2: High Herb Quotient. Faq Content3: Customers say that regular massages with Fat Burning & Oil, enriched with herbs such as Triphala and Castor oil, improve skin texture and reduce the appearance of cellulite. Faq Content6: The product has a shelf life of 3 years from the date of manufacturing. Please refer to the packaging for the exact expiry date. Faq Question5: What is the shelf life of this product?. Faq Content5: Drink plenty of water, eat a low-carb diet, and work out regularly. Massage yourself every day with slimming oil to improve blood flow and stop fat from building up. Faq Content4: No. The natural warming herbs in Blue Nectar's Ayurvedic Slimming Oil promote circulation