ending on individual skin type and usage. However, with regular use, visible improvements within 4 to 5 weeks. Faq Question5: How long does it take to see results?. Faq Content4: Yes, due to ingredients like Sandalwood, Saffron, and Licorice, it can help reduce acne marks, scars, and pigmentation over time. Faq Question4: Does Kumkumadi serum help with acne and scars?. Faq Question3: What is the English name for Kumkumadi?. Faq Content2: Kumkumadi oil helps lessen under-eye pigmentation and nourishes fragile skin, thus reducing the look of dark circles with regular application. Faq Question2: Can Kumkumadi oil remove dark circles?. Faq Content1: Yes, it is generally suitable for all skin types. However, dry skin benefits from its moisturizing properties. Oily or acne-prone skin should use it sparingly and opt for non-comedogenic versions. Always patch test first. Faq Question1: Is Kumkumadi serum suitable for all skin types?. Faq Content6: The product has a shelf life of 3 years from the date of manufacturing. Please refer to the packaging for the exact expiry date. Faq Question5: What is the shelf life of this product?. Faq Content3: Kumkumadi is commonly referred to as 'saffron oil' in English because saffron (Kumkuma) is a vital ingredient. Complete Ingredients: Ingredient Scientific Name Benefit Kumkuma Crocus sativus Brightening, De-pigmentation & Nourishment Usira Vetiveria zizanoides Moisturizing, Soothing & Repairing Lodhra Symplocos Reduces scars, wrinkles & other blemishes. Patranga Caesalpinia Sappan Prevents, acne, pimples & dark spots Raktachandan Pterocarpus Santalinus Anti-Aging Anti pimples & Brightening Kaliyaka (Agaru) Aquilaria agallocha Roxb Cleansing & Exfoliation Manjistha Rubia cordifolia Improves blood circulation & De- Pigmentation Yashtimadhu Glycyrrhiza glabra Anti-Aging De-Tan, Glowing Skin Padmak Nelumbo nucifera Helps in Brightening & Moisturize Sesame Sesamum indicum Protects with antioxidants, and reduces inflammation for skin Gorocha