{"type":"response","data":{"products":[{"handle":"hair-serum-for-growth-hair-tonic-oil-spray-for-frizz-free-smooth-styling","title":"Rosemary Hair Tonic for Hair growth (8 herbs, 100ml)","description":"Rosemary hair growth tonic helps to control hair fall naturally and promote hair growth. Consisting of 8 Ayurvedic herbs like rosemary, almond, bhringraj, aloe vera, hibiscus, etc, rosemary helps to nourish hair from root to tip. You can use it as a rosemary hair spray for styling without requiring a strong hold. Suitable for all hair types, this hair growth tonic could also be used as a substitute for rosemary water for hair. Rated 4.97/5 (1319 reviews). Use Product: The Ayurveda Lab ™- Rosemary — In Ayurveda, Rosemary is called Rusmari. According to ancient texts, Rosemary is believed to be a divine herb, gifted to humankind by Dhanvantari, the god of medicine. It is said that Dhanvantari brought Rosemary from the celestial gardens to help promote hair growth, strengthen hair roots, and revitalize the scalp. Why Blue: Science Backed Benefits — Findings: A study published in Skin Appendage Disorders in 2023 highlighted rosemary oil's potential in improving hair growth. The research involved 100 participants aged 18-49. They were randomly divided into two groups: one applying a rosemary oil solution and the other a 2% minoxidil solution. Both groups applied 1 ml of their assigned solution to the scalp twice daily for a period of 6 months. Participants in the rosemary oil group reported significantly less scalp itching, a reduction in hair fall, and good hair growth. Journal- Skin Appendage Disorders, 2023. Blue: Ingredients Transparency — All Herbs declared on products in form of Herb Quotient; With more than 150 quality herbs, our products have High Herb Quotient; Free From Harmful Chemicals — All our products are free from harmful chemicals & mineral oils. Product Footer Description: Hair Tonic and Rosemary water for Hair Growth Outside environmental factors like pollution, dirt, and harmful particles like PM2.5 and PM10 cause significant harm to our hair and scalp. Together, these factors lead to the thick crust formations seen in heavily processed hair. Keeping your hair healthy and vibrant is not just something to do now and again; it requires a commitment to a routine. Using a hair growth tonic will help repair damaged hair. It will also strengthen and nourish your hair for a long time. The market has many hair care products. Ayurvedic products are recommended because they use natural and plant based ingredients. Ayurvedic oils are often rich in strong herbs. Bhringraj oil, sesame oil, and coconut oil are popular examples. People have used these oils for a long time to treat hair fall, dandruff, and thin hair. Today, products like rosemary hair serum and hair tonic provide a light and strong option. They help customers improve hair manageability and growth. What is a Hair Tonic? A hair tonic is a liquid-based hair care product designed to nourish and rejuvenate hair from the root to the tip. In contrast to conventional oils, hair tonics are non-greasy and lightweight and are thus suited for daily use. Plant herbs and essential oils form the majority of hair tonics. These include rosemary, hibiscus, almond, and bhringraj. These Ayurvedic herbs help to moisturize, strengthen, and rejuvenate the hair. Another important feature of hair tonics is that we can apply them as a leave-in treatment. You can rinse them off later. Also, they are naturally free of toxic chemicals (i.e., they are a clean alternative to synthetic). Incorporating a hair tonic for hair growth into your routine can address common issues like frizz, dryness, and breakage while encouraging healthy hair development. Why use Ayurvedic Hair Tonics? The advantages of Ayurvedic hair tonics extend far beyond just hair care. These products offer targeted solutions for various hair concerns: Moisturizing Dry Hair: One of the biggest threats to modern hairstyles is dryness. This dryness comes from washing too much and environmental factors. Hair tonic cements moisture and thus makes the hair soft, smooth and easier to work with Reducing Tangles: Tangled hair can result in inappropriate breakage and hair loss. A rosemary hair serum that helps detangle hair. It smooths the strands and reduces knots, making combing easier. Stimulating Hair Growth: Ingredients like Bhringraj and rosemary water help improve blood flow in the scalp. This augmented flow of circulation triggers dormant follicles, which sets the stage for healthier and faster growth of hair. Improving Hair Texture: Using a hair tonic regularly can change your hair's texture. It helps reduce frizz and makes your hair smooth and shiny. By itself, the hydration capacity of rosemary and hibiscus provides the hair with a silky smooth and shiny look. Enhancing Shine: A hair tonic for growth does more than nourish your hair. It also adds a natural shine by improving its health and vitality. This glossy finish creates a polished and sophisticated look. Strengthening Hair: Ayurvedic agents are mixes of powerful herbs like rosemary and hibiscus. These herbs make hair stronger and less likely to break. They also help hair grow longer and healthier. Reducing Itchiness: Dryness and itching of the scalp are common problems. They can lead to dandruff and hair loss. A rosemary serum helps keep the scalp hydrated. This can prevent problems and create a healthy base for hair. Blue Nectar Hair Tonic: The Perfect Solution If you want a full solution for your hair problems, try Blue Nectar's Hair Tonic for Hair Growth. It contains a blend of Ayurvedic herbs that may help improve your hair. This special formula has eight strong ingredients. These include rosemary, hibiscus, bhringraj, and almond oil. Together, they help to strengthen and refresh your hair. Hibiscus acts as a natural conditioner, providing deep hydration and restoring elasticity to the hair shaft. It restores damage introduced in the environment, so that your hair is free from roughness and stickiness. Rosemary water for hair helps with many issues. It can prevent early graying and dandruff. It also nourishes hair follicles for more shine. Bhringraj exerts a crucial role in promoting blood circulation to the scalp, reactivating the hair follicle and inducing growth. In the meantime, almond oil reduces the friction during hair styling, which leads to softer hair, shinier hair and more resilient hair. This light, non-greasy formula works well for all hair types. Everyone can use this restoring treatment. The pleasant smell of rosemary in this serum comes from its natural oils. It feels nice to use it every day. Its moisturizing and non-heavy feeling keeps the hair manageable and stylish all day long. How to use Blue Nectar Hair Tonic Adding Blue Nectar hair tonic for hair strengthening to your daily routine is easy but signific. Custom Tab Title: Works as Rosemary Water | Plant-based alternate to Redensyl. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Description Title: Know your Product. Faqs: Q.1 Can it be used as leave in Serum? Yes. It is effective as Leave in Serum as well. Q.2 Does it make hair look Oily or Normal? Normal Q.3 Is it helpful for hair regrowth for half baldness? Blue Nectar Briganantadi Hair Tonic has vital natural ingredients like rosemary, almond oil, hibiscus, Briganantadi etc that help revitalise hair follicles. It helps to control untimely hair loss and may help acccelerate hair growth. Q.4 Is it a unisex product? It is a unisex product. It can be used by both, men and women, with complete confidence. Q.5 Can we mix it with other essential oils and then use the mixture on the scalp? Almond and Rosemary Hair Tonic is already infused with active vital herbs as well as high-quality essential oils. If you want to mix with other essential oils, you can always do that. It will only improve the efficacy of the tonic. Please use only good quality essential oils, and do not use any artificial or mineral oil to mix. How-To-Use: To maintain or get a bouquet of healthy hair on your head, use a hair tonic after every wash. Try to blow dry hair before use of Hair Tonic. This is because water will dilute the tonic or prevent it from penetrating your scalp. The heat from the hairdryer will also open up the pores so they can better absorb the tonic. Apply hair tonic only on the crown area as it will flow down to other areas naturally. Then massage the tonic into the scalp with your fingertips. There is no need to rinse it off. Is-This-For-Me: Do you have dry or frizzy hair? OR Are you looking for smooth styling of your hair after hair wash, without strong hold? OR Are you facing localised baldness or Hairloss? OR Are you feel your hair are thinning with age? OR If you have ticked YES as an answer to any of above questions, then it is time for you to order Briganantadi Hair Tonic Hair Serum Spray. Media-Reviews: A happy blogger https://prettylittlethings.winkl.co/content/blue-nectar-9969ef a. Weight: 100.0000. Short Description: Blue Nectar Brignanantadi Hair Tonic is a light hair serum which works as a hair tonic spray for smooth styling of hair without a strong hold. Enriched with vital active powerful herbs like Bhringraj, Mulethi, Brahmi, Almond Oil, Coconut Oil, Rosemary and Aloe Vera it is a hair serum spray for men and women both, with a light hibiscus fragrance keeping your hair fresh for entire day. Reviews: Customer Reviews Based on 12 reviews Write a review. Hsn: 300490. Ingredients Content1: Rosemary - Redensyl Rosemary has anti-inflammatory properties that promote nerve growth & improve circulation. Benefit Content 3: Non-Sticky Nourishment Almond for non-sticky nourishment penetrates the scalp and nourishes it to make follicles strong. Benefit Content 2: Reduces Dandruff & itchiness Ayurvedic herbs in this tonic help to reduce hairfall and retain moisture that prevents dryness in the scalp. Benefit Content: Promotes Hair Growth It increases or stimulates the circulation of blood to the scalp, which nourishes & promotes hair growth. Ayurvedic Description: Plant Based Herbs: Rosemary & Bhringraj Use for: As Hair Growth tonic or Rosemary water for Hair Suitable For: All Type of Hair. Complete Ingredients Heading: Complete Ingredients List. Blue Heading 2: High Herb Quotient. Complete Ingredients: Ingredient Scientific Name Benefit Bhringraj Eclipta prostrata Prevents hair loss & dandruff Almond Oil Prunus dulcis Makes hair smoother to the touch & nourishes scalp Hibiscus Hibiscus rosa-sinensis Thickens hair & adds volume Rosemary Ext. Salvia rosmarinus Prevents premature graying & dandruff Plash Beej Butea monosperma Improves hair growth & strengthens roots Mulethi Glycyrrhiza glabra Promotes blood circulation in the scalp & soothes irritation Jatamansi Nardostachys jatamansi Promotes hair growth & conditions scalp Brahmi Bacopa monnieri Reduces dryness, itchiness & flakiness Coconut Oil Cocos nucifera Provides moisture to tame frizz & heals breakage Aloe Vera Ext. Aloe barbadensis miller Hydrates scalp & soothes irritation Propyl Glycol Propylene Glycol Helps in moisture retention & improves ingredient absorption Sodium Benzoate Sodium Benzoate Helps prevent spoilage & maintains freshness Phenoxyethanol Phenoxyethanol Helps prevent spoilage & stabilizes formulation. Faq Content3: Yes, it is highly effective as a leave-in serum. It is light to wear and keeps hair and scalp well conditioned. Faq Content6: The product has a shelf life of 3 years from the date of manufacturing. Please refer to the packaging for the exact expiry date. Faq Question5: What is the shelf life of this product?. Faq Content5: Rosemary helps to prevent hair loss by strengthening roots and increasing scalp health. Its antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties help to prevent thinning. Consistent use may naturally reduce hair loss. Faq Question5: Can Rosemary help you stop losing hair?. Faq Content4: A hair tonic nourishes the scalp, boosts circulation, and replenishes nutrients. This promotes stronger and faster hair growth. Consistent use yields visible outcomes. Faq Question4: Does using a hair tonic accelerate hair growth?. Faq Question3: Can we use Blue Nectar's hair tonic as a leave-in hair serum?. Faq Content2: It is a unisex product. It can be used by both men and women. Faq Question2: Is this hair growth and hair serum a unisex product?. Faq Content1: Yes, Rosemary is known to increase blood circulation in the scalp. This strengthens the hair follicles and promotes natural hair growth. Regular usage promotes thicker, healthier hair. Faq Question1: Is Rosemary beneficial for hair growth?. Ingredients Content3: Almond Oil Almond oil makes your hair feel smoother to the touch. Using almond oil on your hair gives it a softer texture over time. Ingredients Content2: Bhringraj One of the most effective natural hair herbs, it adds strength & shine to hair, prevents hair fall & promotes hair growth.","price":"710.00","link":"https://www.bluenectar.co.in/products/hair-serum-for-growth-hair-tonic-oil-spray-for-frizz-free-smooth-styling?variant=37858033926316","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_a90ee2e4-dae5-496d-b45c-e5d4632dbee4.jpg?v=1768986060","variants":[{"variant_id":37858033926316,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"HCBGTL100","taxable":true,"available":true,"price":"710.00","compare_at_price":"715.00","position":1,"product_id":6197473575084,"created_at":"2021-01-14T12:07:49.000Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T06:32:17.000Z","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_a90ee2e4-dae5-496d-b45c-e5d4632dbee4.jpg?v=1768986060","id":37858033926316,"url":"https://www.bluenectar.co.in/products/hair-serum-for-growth-hair-tonic-oil-spray-for-frizz-free-smooth-styling?variant=37858033926316"}],"default_variant_id":37858033926316,"selectedVariant":{"variant_id":37858033926316,"title":"Default Title","price":"710.00","compare_at_price":"715.00","available":true,"option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null}}],"handles":["hair-serum-for-growth-hair-tonic-oil-spray-for-frizz-free-smooth-styling"],"productsMeta":{"currency":"₹","_id":"698398c46a82559b5200d1f2"},"prompts":[],"pageContext":true,"selectedVariantId":37858033926316,"variantImage":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_a90ee2e4-dae5-496d-b45c-e5d4632dbee4.jpg?v=1768986060","variantTitle":"Default Title","variantPrice":"710.00","variantAvailable":true}}

