ant role in rejuvenating our skin.Aside from this, this oil includes 15 other ayurvedic ingredients that we mentioned above, that ultimately helps in overall wellbeing of our skin.The diversity of ingredients and effectiveness makes the Nalpamaradi Thailam or oil stand tallest among other skincare product. Benefits of Nalpamaradi Thailam: Nalpamaradi Oil is a product whose each drop holds a ton of benefits.This product that is a home to 16 different herbs are known the help skin in every aspect.Some of the key benefits are as follows: Whiten & brighten: Ubtan or turmeric which is one of the 16 herbal ingredients that this oil consists of, are the drivers of brighter and whiter skin.The turmeric helps in removing tan, dirt and providing an even tone to your skin which further results in a glowy look. Hydration: Skin without moisture is almost like a plant without water, the skin will dry out and may show cracks, in case it lacks moisture.The Nalpamaradi oil includes sesame oil as one of its ingredient that plays very crucial role in nourishing our skin.The oil along with other herbs enriches our skin with moisture for a healthier look. Acne and Blemishes: Nalpamaradi Oil possess anti-inflammatory and antibac. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Description Title: Know your Product. Faqs: Q.1 Can i use it on oily skin? Yes, it is suitable for all types of skins. Better to use a herbal body wash after applying Nalpamaradi Oil overnight in case of oily skin. Q.2 How to use it like apply before bath or after? Best is to use before bath. Leave it on skin after application for 30 minutes before you take your bath. It may leave a slight yellowish tinge on skin due to genuine active turmeric extract. Q.3 Can i use this on my 5yrs old kid? Blue Nectar Nalpamaradi is completely natural and does not contain any artificial chemicals. It may be safely used for children. You may also want to check out Blue 