e tonic. Please use only good quality essential oils, and do not use any artificial or mineral oil to mix. How-To-Use: To maintain or get a bouquet of healthy hair on your head, use a hair tonic after every wash. Try to blow dry hair before use of Hair Tonic. This is because water will dilute the tonic or prevent it from penetrating your scalp. The heat from the hairdryer will also open up the pores so they can better absorb the tonic. Apply hair tonic only on the crown area as it will flow down to other areas naturally. Then massage the tonic into the scalp with your fingertips. There is no need to rinse it off. Is-This-For-Me: Do you have dry or frizzy hair? OR Are you looking for smooth styling of your hair after hair wash, without strong hold? OR Are you facing localised baldness or Hairloss? OR Are you feel your hair are thinning with age? OR If you have ticked YES as an answer to any of above questions, then it is time for you to order Briganantadi Hair Tonic Hair Serum Spray. Media-Reviews: A happy blogger https://prettylittlethings.winkl.co/content/blue-nectar-9969ef a. Weight: 100.0000. Short Description: Blue Nectar Brignanantadi Hair Tonic is a light hair serum which works as a hair tonic spray for smooth styling of hair without a strong hold. Enriched with vital active powerful herbs like Bhringraj, Mulethi, Brahmi, Almond Oil, Coconut Oil, Rosemary and Aloe Vera it is a hair serum spray for men and women both, with a light hibiscus fragrance keeping your hair fresh for entire day. Reviews: Customer Reviews Based on 12 reviews Write a review. Hsn: 300490. Ingredients Content1: Rosemary - Redensyl Rosemary has anti-inflammatory properties that promote nerve growth & improve circulation. Benefit Content 3: Non-Sticky Nourishment Almond for non-sticky nourishment penetrates the scalp and nourishes it to make follicles strong. Benefit Content 2: Reduces Dandruff & itchiness Ayurvedic herbs in this tonic help to reduce hairfall and retain moisture that prevents dryness in the scalp. Benefit Content: Promotes Hair Growth It increases or stimulates the circulation of blood to the scalp, which nourishes & promotes hair growth. Ayurvedic Description: Plant Based Herbs: Rosemary & Bhringraj Use for: As Hair Growth tonic or Rosemary water for Hair Suitable For: All Type of Hair. Complete Ingredients Heading: Complete Ingredients List. Blue Heading 2: High Herb Quotient. Complete Ingredients: Ingredient Scientific Name Benefit Bhringraj Eclipta prostrata Prevents hair loss & dandruff Almond Oil Prunus dulcis Makes hair smoother to the touch & nourishes scalp Hibiscus Hibiscus rosa-sinensis Thickens hair & adds volume Rosemary Ext. Salvia rosmarinus Prevents premature graying & dandruff Plash Beej Butea monosperma Improves hair growth & strengthens roots Mulethi Glycyrrhiza glabra Promotes blood circulation in the scalp & soothes irritation Jatamansi Nardostachys jatamansi Promotes hair growth & conditions scalp Brahmi Bacopa monnieri Reduces dryness, itchiness & flakiness Coconut Oil Cocos nucifera Provides moisture to tame frizz & heals breakage Aloe Vera Ext. Aloe barbadensis miller Hydrates scalp & soothes irritation Propyl Glycol Propylene Glycol Helps in moisture retention & improves ingredient absorption Sodium Benzoate Sodium Benzoate Helps prevent spoilage & maintains freshness Phenoxyethanol Phenoxyethanol Helps prevent spoilage & stabilizes formulation. Faq Content3: Yes, it is highly effective as a leave-in serum. It is light to wear and keeps hair and scalp well conditioned. Faq Content6: The product has a shelf life of 3 years from the date of manufacturing. Please refer to the packaging for the exact expiry date. Faq Question5: What is the shelf life of this product?. Faq Content5: Rosemary helps to prevent hair loss by strengthening roots and increasing scalp health. Its antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties help to prevent thinning. Consistent use may naturally reduce hair loss. Faq Question5: Can Rosemary help you stop losing hair?. Faq Content4: A hair tonic nourishes the scalp, boosts circulation, and replenishes nutrients. This promotes stronger and faster hair growth. Consistent use yields visible outcomes. Faq Question4: Does using a hair tonic accelerate hair growth?. Faq Question3: Can we use Blue Nectar's hair tonic as a leave-in hair serum?. Faq Content2: It is a unisex product. It can be used by both men and women. Faq Question2: Is this hair growth and hair serum a unisex product?. Faq Content1: Yes, Rosemary is known to increase blood circulation in the scalp. This strengthens the hair follicles and promotes natural hair growth. Regular usage promotes thicker, healthier hair. Faq Question1: Is Rosemary beneficial for hair growth?. Ingredients Content3: Almond Oil Almond oil makes your hair feel smoother to the touch. Using almond oil on your hair gives it a softer texture over time. Ingredients Content2: Bhringraj One of the most effective natural hair herbs, it adds strength & shine to hair, prevents hair fall & promotes hair growth.","price":"710.00","link":"https://www.bluenectar.co.in/products/hair-serum-for-growth-hair-tonic-oil-spray-for-frizz-free-smooth-styling?variant=37858033926316","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_a90ee2e4-dae5-496d-b45c-e5d4632dbee4.jpg?v=1768986060","variants":[{"variant_id":37858033926316,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"HCBGTL100","taxable":true,"available":true,"price":"710.00","compare_at_price":"715.00","position":1,"product_id":6197473575084,"created_at":"2021-01-14T12:07:49.000Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T01:46:36.000Z","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_a90ee2e4-dae5-496d-b45c-e5d4632dbee4.jpg?v=1768986060","id":37858033926316,"url":"https://www.bluenectar.co.in/products/hair-serum-for-growth-hair-tonic-oil-spray-for-frizz-free-smooth-styling?variant=37858033926316"}],"default_variant_id":37858033926