ry help you stop losing hair?. Faq Content4: A hair tonic nourishes the scalp, boosts circulation, and replenishes nutrients. This promotes stronger and faster hair growth. Consistent use yields visible outcomes. Faq Question4: Does using a hair tonic accelerate hair growth?. Faq Question3: Can we use Blue Nectar's hair tonic as a leave-in hair serum?. Faq Content2: It is a unisex product. It can be used by both men and women. Faq Question2: Is this hair growth and hair serum a unisex product?. Faq Content1: Yes, Rosemary is known to increase blood circulation in the scalp. This strengthens the hair follicles and promotes natural hair growth. Regular usage promotes thicker, healthier hair. Faq Question1: Is Rosemary beneficial for hair growth?. Ingredients Content3: Almond Oil Almond oil makes your hair feel smoother to the touch. Using almond oil on your hair gives it a softer texture over time. Ingredients Content2: Bhringraj One of the most effective natural hair herbs, it adds strength & shine to hair, prevents hair fall & promotes hair growth.","price":"710.00","link":"https://www.bluenectar.co.in/products/hair-serum-for-growth-hair-tonic-oil-spray-for-frizz-free-smooth-styling?variant=37858033926316","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_a90ee2e4-dae5-496d-b45c-e5d4632dbee4.jpg?v=1768986060","variants":[{"variant_id":37858033926316,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"HCBGTL100","taxable":true,"available":true,"price":"710.00","compare_at_price":"715.00","position":1,"product_id":6197473575084,"created_at":"2021-01-14T12:07:49.000Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T01:46:36.000Z","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_a90ee2e4-dae5-496d-b45c-e5d4632dbee4.jpg?v=1768986060","id":37858033926316,"url":"https://www.bluenectar.co.in/products/hair-serum-for-growth-hair-tonic-oil-spray-for-frizz-free-smooth-styling?variant=37858033926316"}],"default_variant_id":37858033926