{"type":"response","data":{"products":[{"handle":"shubhr-plant-based-kojic-acid-face-serum","title":"Shubhr Kojic Acid Serum for Pigmentation and Dark Spots with Rice Water and Mushroom(13 herbs, 30ml)","description":"Shubhr Kojic Acid Serum targets pigmentation and dark spots. This is sourced from plant sources like fermented rice water & mushrooms. It's a 100% Ayurvedic formulation consisting of 13 Ayurvedic herbs. This rice water serum with mushroom extracts is suitable for all skin types and can be used by men or women. It reduces melanin production, which helps to control pigmentation. This lightweight, non-greasy serum provides a natural way to address pigmentation, with the benefits of mushrooms and fermented rice water. Rated 4.95/5 (462 reviews). Use Product: The Ayurveda Lab ™-Mushrooms — Shiitake mushrooms have been cultivated since 1209 AD in China, as recorded in the \"Records of Longquan County\" by He Zhan. They are the oldest known cultivated mushrooms. Traditionally, Shiitake was dried, ground, or soaked to make pastes or infusions for skin use. Rich in Kojic acid, it was applied to help reduce blemishes and lighten dark spots. Why Blue: Science Backed Benefits — Findings: In a clinical study, 20 volunteers applied a mushroom extract-based product daily for 8 weeks. The results showed significant improvements: a 16% reduction in wrinkles, a 9.4% decrease in melanin (pigmentation), and enhanced skin hydration, firmness, and elasticity. Notably, 95% of participants reported visible improvements, confirming mushroom's effectiveness in reducing pigmentation and promoting overall skin health. Journal- International Journal of Molecular Sciences, 2022. Blue: Ingredients Transparency — All Herbs declared on products in form of Herb Quotient; With more than 150 quality herbs, our products have High Herb Quotient; Free From Harmful Chemicals — All our products are free from harmful chemicals & mineral oils. Custom Tab Title: Reduces Dark Spots | Rice Water Face Serum. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Description Title: Know your Product. Product Footer Description: Kojic Acid Serum- The Power of Plants Hey, don't let the word acid throw you off! Kojic serum, especially in its plant-based form, is actually super gentle and totally safe for your skin. Imagine all the benefits, minus any harshness- just pure plant goodness for that glow-up! The next question that comes to mind is: What is Kojic Acid? It is a natural substance derived from certain types of fungi that can be found in fermented foods. Appreciated by people with dark spots and pigmentation problems, The serum acts on the melanin which is the pigment that gives skin its color. How is Fermented Rice Water and Mushroom the Best Plant-Based Alternative in Kojic Serum? This is not your average serum! Blue Nectar's is giving you a plant-powered face serum with the glow-getting combo of fermented rice water and mushroom extract. These superstars aren't just along for the ride; they're the real MVPs, packing in some serious brightening and hydrating properties. Let's learn how: 1. Fermented Rice Water: Haven't you come across the trending tik-tok hacks using rice water. Well its a real life secret ingredient that is a must to add in your skincare routines. Rice water's been the secret weapon of glowing skin since forever. But this isn't just any rice water- it's fermented, meaning it's totally boosted with vitamins and antioxidants. What does that mean for you? Bye-bye pigmentation: This rice water serum has got the skills to fade dark spots and even out your skin tone, so you can rock that fresh-faced look. It is the best serum for dark spots. Silky smooth feels: With all its natural starchiness, rice water gives your skin a soft, smooth finish that's impossible to resist. Pollution warrior: Packed with antioxidants, it shields your skin from the grime of the day, so you stay glowing 24/7.