ation 5. Eco-Friendly: A plant-based alternative does wonders for your complexion, but it also helps the planet. Sustainably sourced, this face serum fits right into eco-friendly beauty trends 6. Natural Ingredients Enriched Serum for Holistic Skin Nourishment: This goes beyond just dealing with pigmentation due to its rich natural content. It takes care of the overall health of your skin, giving you a healthy glowing complexion Why Go for Blue Nectar's Plant-Based Kojic Serum? Presenting Blue Nectar's Plant-Based Kojic Serum With Almond & Olive Oil. Under the clouds of pigmentation or dark spots, this face serum has you covered- literally! With its nature-inspired ingredients of fermented rice water and mushrooms, this one is for all skin types; gentle on your skin but great in efficacy. And here's the kicker: it's completely Ayurvedic. Featuring 13 Ayurvedic herbs in its formulation, this serum not only targets pigmentation but also carries age-old knowledge into a contemporary must-have for skincare. The formula's lightweight, non-greasy vibe (thanks, almond oil!) means it's not just good for dark spots- it helps even out your skin tone and leaves it feeling smooth a. Ayurvedic Description: What's Unique: Plant Based Kojic Acid Plant Based Herbs: Mushroom & Rice Water Use for: Anti-Pigmentation and Even Skin Tone For Whom: Both Men & Women. Benefit Content: Targets Pigmentation Formulated with kojic acid, addresses pigmentation issues, and works wonders, offering a clearer and brighter complexion. Making it an essential addition to your skincare routine. Benefit Content 2: Even Skin Tone Restore your skin's radiance with our Kojic Face Serum, it evens out skin tone for a brighter complexion. This serum revitalizes your look, offering a renewed and confident appearance effortlessly. Benefit Content 3: Reduces Dark Spots The lightweight, non-greasy formula absorbs swiftly and can help reduce Dark Spots, providing a more even skin tone and a radiant complexion. Faq 