{"type":"response","data":{"products":[{"handle":"kojic-acid-cream-pigmentation","title":"2% Kojic Acid Face Cream for Pigmentation with Mushroom & Rice Water (18 Herbs, 50g)","description":"Blue Nectar 2% Kojic Acid Face Cream is a powerful blend of 18 ayurvedic herbs, a solution to target pigmentation and dark spots. Enriched with natural Kojic Acid sourced from fermented rice water and mushrooms, it helps even skin tone and boosts radiance. Its lightweight, non-greasy texture absorbs quickly, making it perfect for all skin types, including oily, dry, and sensitive skin. Free from parabens, sulfates, and artificial fragrances, this face moisturizer is a safe, chemical-free choice for naturally radiant, nourished, and glowing skin. Rated 5.0/5 (1 reviews). Blue: Ingredients Transparency — All Herbs declared on products in form of Herb Quotient; With more than 150 quality herbs, our products have High Herb Quotient; Free From Harmful Chemicals — All our products are free from harmful chemicals & mineral oils. Why Blue: Rice Water & Mushroom - Research — Rice Water Journal: National Library Medicine 2022 Findings: Components in rice, like tricin, betaine, squalene, phenolic compounds, and rice bran, have skin-benefiting effects. Shiitake Mushroo Journal: International Journal of Research Publication and Review, Sep 2023 Findings: Shiitake mushrooms have a positive effect on SOD levels and collagen amount and may be a potential natural agent for preventing photoaging due to UVB exposure. Use Product: The Ayurveda Lab ™- Kojic Acid — K. Saito discovered kojic acid in 1907 by extracting it from the koji mold (Aspergillus oryzae) during steamed rice fermentation, which is an important stage in traditional sake manufacture. Yabuta publicized the term \"kojic acid\" in 1913, elevating it from culinary tradition to scientific recognition. Originally thought to improve flavor and preservation in Japanese food, kojic acid's true brilliance lies in its molecular ability to inhibit tyrosinase, the enzyme responsible for melanin formation. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Custom Tab Title: Reduces Pigmentation | Improves Skin Tone. Description Title: Know your Product. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Faqs: Q.1 Is it suitable for oily skin? It is suitable for all skin type. Q.2 Which one is best anti aging and brighting cream for dry skin? Blue Nectar has three anti ageing and brightening creams - Sandalwood Saffron, Jasmine Pachouli and Flower Valley. All three have delivered excellent results for many of our customers. It is tough to say which one is better, as all three have different fragrances as well natural ingredients, that are known since ancient times to make soon appear youthful with a genuine face glow. My personal favourite is Flower Valley which has an amazing effect as well as aroma, but our best selling cream is Anti Ageing Sandalwood Saffron. Q.3 Which one is best anti aging and brighting cream for dry skin? The answer would vary from person to person. You can try either Jasmine Pachouli Night Repair cream, or Sandalwood Saffron Cream. They leverage power of different herbs and natural ingredients helping skin fight effects of aging naturally and provide a brightening glow to the skin. Q.4 Is it suitable for pimple prone oily skin ? Yes, ingredients like Nagkesar, Ananthmool. Kokum and Van haldi make this cream suitable for oily skin as well. Do wash your face with rose water before applying the cream on a moist face. Q.5 Is it only for women ? Men's cream variant is also available for the same cream. Q.6 What age group is recommended to use this product? Blue Nectar Jasmine Pachouli Cream is rich in natural ingredients and has a high herbs quotient. It is suitable for all age groups. Presence of vital active ingredients like Cow ghee, Almond Oil, Khumani Tailam, Jasmine and Pachouli Oil makes it an ideal cream for 25+ age hroup to help skin repair itself naturally. Q.7 Can i use this as a night cream? Yes, it is actually a night cream. Q.8 Is it suitable for dry skin? Presence of completely natural ingredients like Almond Oil, Apricot Oil, Jasmine Oil and Pachouli Oil makes it a great cream for dry skin. Herbs-Quotient: Blue Nectar Jasmine & Pachouli Night Repair Cream for women contains 16 Vital Ayurvedic herbs like Organic Ghee, Haldi, Almond Oil etc. Herbs & hydrators present in Blue Nectar Nourishing & repair cream may help to deliver vital nutrition to skin. Organic Ghee in cream is an effective moisturiser. Turmeric is known to be anti bacterial and may help to brighten dark circles. Mulethi contained in Shubhr Night Cream is loaded with ample benefits that may help to give skin fairness & glow. How-To-Use: Before going to the bed in night, clean face, massage peanut size cream using firm hands with upward circular motion. Is-This-For-Me: For Oily Skin:Presence of ingredients, which work in tandem with each other, such as Haldi, Nagkesar, Apple, Anantmool and Mulethi make this cream to be good for oily skin. In case of very oily skin, cleanse face with a mild herbal face wash or plain rose water before applying the cream in small quantity in circular upward motion. For Dry Skin:Presence of completely natural ingredients like Almond Oil, Apricot Oil, Jasmine Oil and Pachouli Oil makes it a great cream for dry skin. For Dark Circles: Turmeric present in this cream is known to be anti bacterial and may help to brighten dark circles. For fairness and Glow: Mulethi contained in Shubhr Night Cream is loaded with ample benefits that may help to give skin fairness & glow. Short Description: Blue Nectar Jasmine & Pachouli Nourishing Night Repair Cream for women contains 16 Ayurvedic herbs and helps to nourish and repair skin from the damage caused on regular basis by pollution, sun exposure. Free from Sulphate/Paraben or any other harmful chemicals, this cream helps in prevent signs of ageing and fine lines. Weight: 50.0000. Ayurvedic Descri