e Water Packed with amino acids and vitamins, rice water soothes, hydrates, and promotes radiant, even-toned skin with a natural glow. Ingredients Content3: Turmeric A powerful Ayurvedic herb, turmeric helps reduce dark spots, fights acne, and enhances skin brightness with its anti-inflammatory and healing properties. Hsn: 300490. Reviews: Customer Reviews Based on 22 reviews Write a review. Complete Ingredients: Ingredient Scientific Name Benefit Rice Water Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract Natural Kojic Acid Mushroom Fomes Officinalis (Mushroom) Extract Skin Brightening Kumkumadi Tailam Kumkumadi Oil (Ayurvedic Herbal Blend) Radiance Boost Aloe Vera Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice Soothing Hydration Lodhra Symplocos Racemosa Bark Extract Pore Tightening Neem Bark Azadirachta Indica Bark Extract Skin Clarification Anantmul Extract Hemidesmus Indicus Root Extract Skin Purification Big Lemon Citrus Medica Limonum (Lemon) Extract Natural AHA Coriander Coriandrum Sativum Extract Antioxidant Care","price":"1120.00","link":"https://www.bluenectar.co.in/products/kojic-acid-cream-pigmentation?variant=46637128581365","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_405aee54-3b65-460b-adc1-aae2ee621394.jpg?v=1758622287","variants":[{"variant_id":46637128581365,"title":"Women","option1":"Women","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"FCKA0050WD","taxable":true,"available":true,"price":"1120.00","compare_at_price":"1125.00","position":1,"product_id":9111327637749,"created_at":"2025-05-14T11:26:17.000Z","updated_at":"2026-04-25T11:45:22.000Z","image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0524/2126/3532/files/1_405aee54-3b65-460b-adc1-aae2ee621394.jpg?v=1758622287","id":46637128581365,"url":"https://www.bluenectar.co.in/products/kojic-acid-cream-pigmentation?variant=46637128581365"},{"variant_id":46637128614133,"title":"Men","option1":"Men","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"FCKA0050MD","taxable":true,"available":true,"price":"1120.00","compare_at_price":"1125.00","position":