 an instant glow to the skin. It should delay the signs of aging and makes firmer skin. Instead of choosing products having chemicals and acids, going for ayurvedic night creams that are curated by active and ayurvedic ingredients can heal the skin naturally. Easily available ingredients like turmeric, ghee, shea butter, honey, almond oil, coconut oil, rosewater, etc. There are special night creams curated with the goodness of these natural ingredients that can give clearer-looking skin and reduces irritation naturally with zero side-effect. Best Night Cream for Men to apply Overnight A naturally enriched cream from Blue Nectar is specially designed to improve nourishment and restore the lost glow. Shubhr Kumkumadi Night Repair Cream for Men is the answer to the question - which night cream is the best night cream for men Kumkumadi Night Repair Cream by Blue Nec. Custom Tab Title: Even Skin Tone | Age Spots | Skin Brightening. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Description Title: Know your Product. Faqs: Q.1 Is this cream suits to oily skin? Presence of ingredients, which work in tandem with each other, such as Haldi, Nagkesar, Apple, Anantmool and Mulethi make this cream to be good for oily skin. In case of very oily skin, cleanse face with a mild herbal face wash or plain rose water before applying the cream in small quantity in circular upward motion. Q.2 Is dis cream only for men ? Yes, this one is for men. You can check out Blue Nectar Jasmine and Pachouli cream for women as well. Q.3 Is it suitable for dry Skin? Yes. Presence of completely natural ingredients like Almond Oil, Apricot Oil, Jasmine Oil and Pachouli Oil makes it a great cream for dry skin. Q.4 Is this suitable for pimple prone oily skin ? Yes, ingredients like Nagkesar, Ananthmool. Kokum and Van haldi make this cream suitable for pimple prone oily skin as well. Do wash your face with rose water or any face wash for pimples before applying the cream on a moist face. Herbs-Quotient: Blue Nectar Jasmine & Pachouli Night Repair Cream for men contains 16 Vital Ayurvedic herbs like Organic Ghee, Haldi, Almond Oil etc. Herbs & hydrators present in Blue Nectar Nourishing & repair cream may help to deliver vital nutrition to skin. Organic Ghee in cream is an effective moisturiser. Turmeric is known to be anti bacterial and may help to brighten dark circles. Mulethi contained in Shubhr Night Cream is loaded with ample benefits that may help to give skin fairness & glow. How-To-Use: Before going to the bed in night, clean face, massage peanut size cream using firm hands with upward circular motion. Is-This-For-Me: For Oily Skin:Presence of ingredients, which work in tandem with each other, such as Haldi, Nagkesar, Apple, Anantmool and Mulethi make this cream to be good for oily skin. In case of very oily skin, cleanse face with a mild herbal face wash or plain rose water before applying the cream in small quantity in circular upward motion. For Dry Skin:Presence of completely natural ingredients like Almond Oil, Apricot Oil, Jasmine Oil and Pachouli Oil makes it a great cream for dry skin. For Dark Circles: Turmeric present in this cream is known to be anti bacterial and may help to brighten dark circles. For fairness and Glow: Mulethi contained in Shubhr Night Cream is loaded with ample benefits that may help to give skin fairness & glow. Weight: 50.0000. Short Description: Blue Nectar Jasmine & Pachouli Nourishing Night Repair Cream for men contains 16 Ayurvedic herbs and helps to nourish and repair skin from the damage caused on regular basis by pollution, sun exposure. Free from Sulphate/Paraben or any other harmful chemicals, this cream helps in prevent signs of ageing and fine lines. Reviews: Customer Reviews Based on 8 reviews Write a review. Hsn: 300490. Ingredients Content1: Kumkumadi Oil It provides radiance & a natural glow to make your skin look young & bright. It also enhances blood circulation and tones the skin when left overnight. Benefit Content 3: Improves Skin Complexion It boosts skins elasticity and helps restore its resilience overnight, revealing smoother skin. It improves overall skin complexion & texture. Also, enhances firmness and elasticity. Benefit Content 2: Fades Dark Spots & Blemishes This night cream is oil-free to give you a fresh look every morning. It penetrates deep into the skin and reduces dark spots & blemishes which helps soothe the skin and give a healthy glowing skin. Benefit Content: Deeply Hydrates & Nourishes the Skin It helps restore dry and damaged skin, as it's a perfect night therapy for youthful, naturally radiant skin. It intensely nourishes & hydrates your skin through the night. Ayurvedic Description: What's Unique: Plant Based Skin Repair Plant Based Herbs: Kumkumadi Oil & Ghee Works well for: Skin Repair & Deep Moisturization Experience: Sensuous Jasmine Aroma. Complete Ingredients Heading: Complete Ingredients List. Blue Heading 2: High Herb Quotient. Complete Ingredients: Ingredient Scientific Name Benefit Organic Cow Ghee Clarified Butter Helps Provide Deep & Lasting Hydration Kokum Extract Garcinia indica Support skin complexion & Detoxification Apple Extract Malus pumila Mill L. Ensures skin whitening Nagkesar extract Mesua Ferra Reduce age spots, scars, & dark areas Anantmool Extract Hemidesmus indicus Keep Skin hydrated & Maintain skin's Elasticity Khus Extract Vetiveria zizanioides L. Nash Diminishes dark spots Dabh Extract Imperata cylindrica (L.) Add Radiance & glow to the dull skin Haldi Extract Curcuma longa Provide glow and luster to the skin Van Haldi Extract Curcuma aromatica Reduce dark patches and impart a glow to the skin Riceseed extract Oryza sativa Improve skin complexion & texture of skin Hari Doob Extract Cynodon dactylon Astringent & De pigmentation Mulethi Extract Glycyrrhiza glabra glow to the skin complexion Almond Oil Prunus dulcis Soothe dry skin & Reduce dark circles Khumani Oil Prunus armeniaca Adds radiance & glow to dull skin Jasmine Oil Jasminum officinale Remove dark spots & Uneven Skin Patchouli Oil Pogostemon cablin Pogostemon cablin Kumkumadi Oil Crocus Sativus Improve Skin Complexion Glycerin Glycerine Reduce age spots, scars, & dark areas Cream base Cream base Used as a Moisturizer Sodium Benzoate Helps prevent Spoilage and maintain freshness Phenoxy Ethanol Helps prevent Spoilage and maintain freshness Vitamin (E) Alpha-tocopherol Reducing UV damage in skin. Faq Content3: Yes, We recommend using it as directed, this night cream will surely improve your skin tone & texture. Faq Content6: The product has a shelf life of 3 years from the date of manufacturing. Please refer to the packaging for the exact expiry date. Faq Question5: What is the shelf life of this product?. Faq Content5: Men can clear their skin overnight by cleaning properly, using a lightweight serum or night cream with ingredients like Vitamin C, Retinol, or Kumkumadi oil, and remaining hydrated. Faq Question5: How can men get clear skin overnight?. Faq Content4: This kumkumadi night cream is made with natural ingredients like Haldi, Anantmool, Mulethi, and etc. make this cream good for oily skin, while ingredients like Almond Oil, Apricot Oil, and Jasmine Oil provide deep hydration to the skin, making it a perfect companion in your night skincare routine. Hence, it is suitable for all skin types. Faq Question4: Which skin type is the Night cream suits for?. Faq Question3: Can this cream help to whiten the skin and Control oil with daily use?. Faq Content2: If you use both, apply the moisturizer first to lock in hydration, followed by the night cream to promote targeted repair and nourishment. Faq Question2: Which should be applied first: night cream or moisturizer?. Faq Content1: In general, night creams can be started in the mid-20s to keep skin hydrated and prevent early indications of aging. Faq Question1: What age is optimum for night cream?. Ingredie