s before applying the cream on a moist face. Herbs-Quotient: Blue Nectar Jasmine & Pachouli Night Repair Cream for men contains 16 Vital Ayurvedic herbs like Organic Ghee, Haldi, Almond Oil etc. Herbs & hydrators present in Blue Nectar Nourishing & repair cream may help to deliver vital nutrition to skin. Organic Ghee in cream is an effective moisturiser. Turmeric is known to be anti bacterial and may help to brighten dark circles. Mulethi contained in Shubhr Night Cream is loaded with ample benefits that may help to give skin fairness & glow. How-To-Use: Before going to the bed in night, clean face, massage peanut size cream using firm hands with upward circular motion. Is-This-For-Me: For Oily Skin:Presence of ingredients, which work in tandem with each other, such as Haldi, Nagkesar, Apple, Anantmool and Mulethi make this cream to be good for oily skin. In case of very oily skin, cleanse face with a mild herbal face wash or plain rose water before applying the cream in small quantity in circular upward motion. For Dry Skin:Presence of completely natural ingredients like Almond Oil, Apricot Oil, Jasmine Oil and Pachouli Oil makes it a great cream for dry skin. For Dark Circles: Turmeric present in this cream is known to be anti bacterial and may help to brighten dark circles. For fairness and Glow: Mulethi contained in Shubhr Night Cream is loaded with ample benefits that may help to give skin fairness & glow. Weight: 50.0000. Short Description: Blue Nectar Jasmine & Pachouli Nourishing Night Repair Cream for men contains 16 Ayurvedic herbs and helps to nourish and repair skin from the damage caused on regular basis by pollution, sun exposure. Free from Sulphate/Paraben or any other harmful chemicals, this cream helps in prevent signs of ageing and fine lines. Reviews: Customer Reviews Based on 8 reviews Write a review. Hsn: 300490. Ingredients Content1: Kumkumadi Oil It provides radiance & a natural glow to make your skin look young & bright. It also enhances blood circulation and tones the skin when left overnight. Benefit Content 3: Improves Skin Complexion It boosts skins elasticity and helps restore its resilience overnight, revealing smoother skin. It improves overall skin complexion & texture. Also, enhances firmness and elasticity. Benefit Content 2: Fades Dark Spots & Blemishes This night cream is oil-free to give you a fresh look every morning. It penetrates deep into the skin and reduces dark spots & blemishes which helps soothe the skin and give a healthy glowing skin. Benefit Content: Deeply Hydrates & Nourishes the Skin It helps restore dry and damaged skin, as it's a perfect night therapy for youthful, naturally radiant skin. It intensely nourishes & hydrates your skin through the night. Ayurvedic Description: What's Unique: Plant Based Skin Repair Plant Based Herbs: Kumkumadi Oil & Ghee Works well for: Skin Repair & Deep Moisturization Experience: Sensuous Jasmine Aroma. Complete Ingredients Heading: Complete Ingredients List. Blue Heading 2: High Herb Quotient. Complete Ingredients: Ingredient Scientific Name Benefit Organic Cow Ghee Clarified Butter Helps Provide Deep & Lasting Hydration Kokum Extract Garcinia indica Support skin complexion & Detoxification Apple Extract Malus pumila Mill L. Ensures skin whitening Nagkesar extract Mesua Ferra Reduce age spots, scars, & dark areas Anantmool Extract Hemidesmus indicus Keep Skin hydrated & Maintain skin's Elasticity Khus Extract Vetiveria zizanioides L. Nash Diminishes dark spots Dabh Extract Imperata cylindrica (L.) Add Radiance & glow to the dull skin Haldi Extract Curcuma longa Provide glow and luster to the skin Van Haldi Extract Curcuma aromatica Reduce dark patches and impart a glow to the skin Riceseed extract Oryza sativa Improve skin complexion & texture of skin Hari Doob Extract Cynodon dactylon Astringent & De pigmentation Mulethi Extract Glycyrrhiza glabra glow to the skin complexion Almond Oil Prunus dulcis Soothe dry skin & Reduce dark circles Kh