{"type":"response","data":{"products":[{"handle":"anti-aging-cream-for-women-best-anti-wrinkle-cream-moisturizer-for-face","title":"Shubhr Anti Aging Cream for Women for Face with Saffron and Sandalwood (14 herbs, 50g)","description":"The Shubhr Saffron & Sandalwood Anti Aging Cream for women combines 14 Ayurvedic herbs to combat aging effectively. Saffron, known for its collagen boosting properties, is very effective in reducing wrinkles and works well as an anti wrinkle face cream. This anti aging face cream for women not only has anti-aging benefits but also deeply hydrates the skin, leading to a luminous and radiant look. Enjoy the luxurious advantages of using Saffron & Sandalwood cream to rejuvenate your skin on a daily basis. Rated 4.93/5 (1146 reviews). Use Product: The Ayurveda Lab ™ - Saffron — Saffron is believed to be made by the twin gods, Ashwini Kumaras. These divine twin physicians, known as the royal healers of the gods, are fabled to have brought powerful herbs and sacred medicines, including those containing saffron, from heaven to earth to help mankind. Why Blue: Science Backed Benefits — Findings: A 2018 clinical trial by Madan and Nanda explored the anti-aging and photoprotective properties of saffron. The study involved 80 participants, aged 30-60, who exhibited early signs of photoaging, including fine lines, wrinkles, and sun spots. Over a period of 12 weeks, participants topically applied a saffron-infused cream daily & 80% felt their skin appeared more youthful and resilient after 12 weeks. Journal- Madan and Nanda in 2018. Blue: Ingredients Transparency — All Herbs declared on products in form of Herb Quotient; With more than 150 quality herbs, our products have High Herb Quotient; Free From Harmful Chemicals — All our products are free from harmful chemicals & mineral oils. Product Footer Description: Choose the Best Anti Aging Cream for Women & Men Time passes, and today, anti-aging is perhaps the most talked-about topic. With time, the skin of a person changes many times. We feel and observe that we are no longer having the glow we once had, it is becoming less elastic, wrinkles and fine lines are setting in, and the glow on our skin is disappearing. The first sign of anti-aging most people notice is a loss of fat beneath the eyes. You have more sensitive skin around your eyes than the rest of your face. Early in their 30s is the most common time when people begin using anti-aging products. Our skin is a fragile asset that needs special care so that it remains young, soft, and radiant. One desires to look marvelous and possess young skin, but it becomes hard to be sure of picking up the right anti-aging skin care products and formulating an anti-wrinkle regime. A wide variety of anti-aging products are available in the market as well as claiming to prevent your skin from looking old and wrinkly. Are they worth it, though? What face product is best for one's skin type, and what should one buy? Choosing the right Anti Aging Face Brightness Cream for your specific skin concern can help you achieve the most effective results. It can make your skin look more soft and supple. Opt for a high-quality herbal formulation like Anti-aging Saffron Cream by Blue Nectar that is free of all harmful preservatives and chemicals. Why we use an Ayurvedic Anti Aging Cream According to Ayurveda, the person's skin is predefined for many reasons. Ayurvedic Anti Aging cream for women or men includes natural ingredients that function well on the skin. From reducing wrinkles to lessening dark spots, it benefits the skin in lots of ways: Minimize Fine Lines and Wrinkles: The most challenging problem of aging is wrinkles. One of them seems to have materialized in every face daily. Moreover, it is utterly hard to remove wrinkles-especially those on the skin's outer surface-without any cosmetic product that would erase these wrinkles. Ayurvedic anti-aging face cream for women & men is sure to show results without side effects. This wrinkle cream contains natural herbs without harmful chemicals. Help in Boosting Skin Elasticity: Natural ingredients in face cream help boost collagen levels naturally while plumping and hydrating the skin. Natural properties of Ayurvedic face cream for women firm and boost the elasticity of the skin. Hydrate and Moisturizer: This face cream for women & men contains an extraordinary mix of exotic oils such as Sandalwood Oil, Almond Oil, & Wheat Germ Oil to provide additional nourishment. This vibrant blend of natural ingredients in this face cream makes it effective for the natural skin glow and a youthful appearance of your skin. Lighten and Brighten the Skin: Ayurvedic face cream for brightening can have a good prospect of making the skin brighter and more luminous. This face cream increases your glow many times. The anti-aging creams that one uses may comprise herbs such as aloe vera which soothe the skin and make it vibrant and glowy. Improves Your Self Confidence: An Ayurvedic Cream gives you skin which looks bright and glowing. Your external beauty not only enhances your self confidence but also the inner self. It is natural for people to develop insecurities the moment they develop any issues related to skin deterioration. They find themselves caught in the hunt of anti aging creams and several other cosmetic products to stop their age markers. How does Blue Nectar's Anti Aging Saffron Cream Help Blue Nectar's Anti Aging Saffron cream is a combination of saffron and Natural Vitamin C which help boost collagen levels naturally whilst plumping and hydrating the skin. This saffron cream is infused with Indian Madder, a natural astringent, that helps in skin firming. This collagen saffron cream offers a blend of skin rejuvenating herbs that help smoothen the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines while restoring skin's youthful plumpness. Cedarwood Oil balances Vata and Kapha properties, providing nourishment and moisturization to the skin. A versatile daily use of this face brightness cream can be used as a day cream or as a night cream, making your skin feel smoother, supple, and softer. Powered with rejuvenating herbs like sandalwood, Cedarwood, Almond Extract, Liquorice, etc, this saffron anti aging cream for women helps replenish moisture and restores skin elasticity. This wrinkle lift anti aging cream for women helps in retaining skin firmness by refining the fine lines and wrinkles. It replenishes your skin with collagen and essential moisture for a fuller appearance of skin. It is gentle on skin and formulated with 13 skin rejuvenating herbs like Aloe Vera, Sandalwood Oil, Turmeric, Indian Madder, Almond Oil for skin and Sesame Oil etc. An ideal anti aging cream for women & men that strengthens the moisture barrier and hydrates the skin without clogging pores. The magic of Saffron Commonly know. Custom Tab Title: Retinol alternate cream for youthful skin. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Description Title: Know your Product. Faqs: Q1. Can i use it as a day cream? Yes, you may use this face cream as a day cream or as a night cream depending on your skin routine. Q2. Does this cream remove pigmentation? Blue Nectar Saffron and Sandalwood cream comprises vital herbs like Saffron, Almond Oil, Plum Oil, Sandalwood etc. These traditional ingredients are known to improve appearance of uneven skin tone and skin pigmentation. Q3. I have a combination skin. Can I use it? Yes you can use this cream during day as a moisturizer. Presence of natural ingredients like Aloe Vera, Almond Oil, Plum Oil, Wheat Germ Oil, Deodaru Oil and Sandalwood Oil make this cream a natural hydrating agent helping skin retain its moisture naturally. For combination skin, will not recommend using serum before applying the cream. One of them should be enough. Q4. Is this cream good for Winter Season? Yes, this cream works well in winter season as well. Plum Oil, Wheat Germ Oil and DeoDaru Oil make it a hydrating cream for effective use in winters. It does not make your skin heavy at all. Q5. I don’t like my face skin as it is oily. Can this cream help me? Hey, having an oily skin is actually better than dry skin. Oily skin tends to age later than dry skin. However, oily skin is prone to acne and pimples. We suggest you to use a good face wash before applying anti-aging cream. This cream gets absorbed quickly without making your face oily and sticky. Sandalwood is light and is a natural astringent. The cream also contains Aloe Vera, which is a gel-based natural moisturiser. Together, all the herbs present in this cream will help to tackle the problem of moisturising the oily skin. Q6. I am 25. Is this cream suitable for me? Yes. Signs of ageing start appearing as early as 25 years of age. This is a completely natural cream and can be used as a regular moisturizing cream to retain youthful feel and appearance of the skin for a long time. Q7. I am looking for Anti-Ageing Cream that help me with Dark Circles as well. Will you recommend this cream for me? While Blue Nectar Shubhr Sandalwood Saffron is an anti-ageing cream par excellence, presence of Plum Oil, along with Fenugreek makes it great for dark circles as well. Q8. Is this cream good for reducing pores? Pores are good for skin as thry help the skin to breathe. However, when these pores become enlarged, they become visible on skin.To tackle the problem of enlarged pores, skin should be clean of dirt, oil and pollution. For this, we recommend you to clean your skin daily with a good herbal face wash gel. It is a misconception that you can close or shrink the pores. In fact, clogging of pores lead to acne and pimples. However, a tighter, firmer skin will help to make those pores appear smaller. Saffron, Almonds, and Rose Water (all found in our cream) helps in a firmer, tighter and clearer skin. We suggest you to clean your face everyday and then massage your skin with Saffron and Sandalwood cream for 4-5 minutes. This will help you with a smoother and clearer skin Q9. Does this contain any SLS, SLES or Parabens? Aboslutely not. None of our creams contains any SLS, SLES or Parabens. Herbs-Quotient: Herb quotient of Shubhr anti ageing Sandalwood Saffron cream is a solid 14. Carefully selected active natural ingredients of this cream are super stars in their own right for antiaging effect. Saffron & Sandalwood are ancient beauty elixir. Manjishtha (astringent, tightens skin), Aloe Vera (smoothens skin, locks moisture), Methi (Fenugreek reduces dark cricles and dark spots), Plum Oil & Wheatgerm Oil (contains antioxidants and Vitamin E, minimizes skin aging) make the herbal quotient of this cream even more potent. How-To-Use: This cream is great for dry skin as well as oily skin. Can be used as a night cream as well as a day cream. Just apply a small amount of cream on your finger tips, and apply dots on washed face. Massage in circular motions, till the cream is well absorbed in skin. Is-This-For-Me: This is a mild antiaging cream which works wonders for all skin types. Anti Ageing Cream for Dry Skin: Apply the cream in the night and leave overnight. Cream will be well abosrbed allowing nutrients to work their magic on skin. Anti Ageing Cream for Oily Skin: Presence of Aloe Vera makes this cream well suited for oily skin. Wash your face with a mild herbal face wash before application of cream, and protect yourself from pollutants. Weight: 50.0000. Short Description: Shubhr anti ageing brightening day and night face cream gives youthful feel to the skin. Natural ingredients help to improve the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines. It contains authentic saffron and powerful active natural herbs that boost skin's natural ability to fight signs of ageing. Reviews: Customer Reviews Based on 70 reviews Write a review. Hsn: 300490. Ingredients Content1: Saffron It can breathe life into your skin, making it radiant. It combats wrinkles, and fine lines and leaves your skin feeling soft, silky, and more elastic. Ingredients Content4: Manjistha Manjistha or Indian madder is a rejuvenating herb. It improves complexion and lightens dark spots. Ingredients Content3: Aloevera Aloe vera not only moisturizes the skin but also helps in reducing fine lines and wrinkles, thus enhancing skin firming. Ingredients Content2: Kumkumadi Oil It helps to moisturize and soften the skin even while enhancing its radiance, it also keeps your skin supple by keeping it hydrated and improving its elasticity. Benefit Content 3: Nourish & Hydrates Skin This anti ageing cream deeply nourishes the skin and works against skin Pigmentation & dark spots, adding a natural glow to the skin. Benefit Content 2: Skin Firming & Skin Radiance Helps maintain the skin's elasticity and provides continuous hydration to the skin. Gives an even tone to the skin. Benefit Content: Reduces Fine Lines & Wrinkles This anti-aging cream effectively fights the signs of aging, leaving your skin feeling softer, silkier, and more elastic. Ayurvedic Description: What's Unique: Plant Based Collagen Booster Plant Based Herbs: Saffron & Sandalwood Works well For: Fine Lines & Wrinkles Experience: Pleasing Saffron Aroma. Blue Heading 2: High Herb Quotient. Faq Content3: It is great for women in their late twenties and beyond, particularly those who are detecting early symptoms of aging or want to keep their skin looking young. Faq Question3: What age group would benefit the most from this cream?. Faq Content2: Yes, natural alternatives to Retinol include Bakuchiol (1%), Kumkumadi Oil (2%), and Ashwagandha (1%). They provide similar anti-aging properties without causing irritation or dryness. Faq Question2: Can natural actives replace synthetic anti-aging chemicals like Retinol?. Faq Content1: Vitamin C insufficiency can lead to drooping skin due to decreased collagen formation. Vitamin A and E deficiencies can also impair skin suppleness and cause premature aging. Faq Question1: Which vitamin deficiency leads to sagging skin?. Faq Content6: The product has a shelf life of 3 years from the date of manufacturing. Please refer to the packaging for the exact expiry date. Faq Question5: What is the shelf life of this product?. Faq Content5: Type I collagen is most effective for tightening the skin. It helps to maintain skin structure, eliminate wrinkles, and increase suppleness. Collagen production can be enhanced by skincare, nutrition, or supplementation. Faq Question5: What collagen is best for skin tightening?. Faq Content4: Its silky texture is unexpectedly light for its richness. The harmonized herbs absorb fast and leave a silky, non-sticky finish. Faq Question4: Due to its high herb content, does the cream seem oily, matte, or velvety?. Complete Ingredients Heading: Complete Ingredients List. Complete Ingredients: Ingredient Scientific Name Benefit Saffron Crocus Sativus Brightening, De-pigmentation & Nourishment Aloe Vera Aloe barbadensis miller Skin moisturization & anti aging Gulab extract Rosa Combats acne & astringent Mulethi extract Glycyrrhiza glabra Brightens skin & reduces Wrinkles Manjistha extract Rubia cordifolia Improves skin complexion & reduces dark spots Methi extract Trigonella foenum-graecum Reduces acne & pimples Haritaki extract Terminalia chebula Moisturising, Soothing & Repairing Van Haldi extract Curcuma aromatica Natural Skin Glow and acne control Kumkumadi Oil Crocus Sativus Brightening, De-pigmentation & Nourishment Almond oil Prunus dulcis Improves complexion & skin tone Plum Oil Prunus domestica Skin moisturization & nourishment Glycerin Glycerine Reduce Age Spots, Scars & Dark Areas Wheat Germ Oil Triticum Vulgare Antiaging & Treats Acne & Scars Deodaru Oil Cedrus deodara Astringent & De pigmentation Cream base Cream base Used as a Moisturizer Sodium Benzoate Helps prevent Spoilage and maintain freshness Phenoxy Ethanol Helps prevent Spoilage and maintain freshness","price":"1090.00","link":"https://ww