{"type":"response","data":{"products":[{"handle":"kumkumadi-face-oil-serum-for-glowing-skin","title":"Kumkumadi Face Serum and Oil with Saffron for Glowing Skin (26 herbs)","description":"Kumkumadi Face Serum for glowing skin is 100% Ayurvedic. Made from 26 herbs, this face serum is clinically proven to brighten skin in 28 days , reduce pigmentation, and fight signs of aging. This face serum, which is also a face oil, is free from any chemicals or preservatives and contains saffron that helps boost skin collagen, keeping the skin youthful and plump. Rated 4.9/5 (2142 reviews). Why Blue: Science Backed Benefits — Findings: A 2014 study found that saffron significantly reduces pigmentation and skin redness. The research involved 100 participants aged 25-55. At the conclusion of the study, 75% of participants in the saffron group reported a noticeable improvement in skin tone and a decrease in redness. Journal- Tropical Journal of Pharmaceutical Research, 2014. Use Product: The Ayurveda Lab ™ - Kumkumadi Oil — 'Kumkumadi' means 'saffron'. Kumkumadi is said to be created by twin gods – Ashwini Kumaras – also known as the royal physicians of God. They are supposed to bring royal herbs and medicines from heaven to earth to help mankind. Kumkumadi Tailam is one such formulation made by them. Blue: Ingredients Transparency — All Herbs declared on products in form of Herb Quotient; With more than 150 quality herbs, our products have High Herb Quotient; Free From Harmful Chemicals — All our products are free from harmful chemicals & mineral oils. Product Footer Description: Kumkumadi Face Serum: Ayurveda's Best-Kept Treasure India has led the way in natural, organic, chemical-free, and cruelty-free skincare products. This is important as the world is now paying attention to these products. We owe it to Indian ayurveda. Ayurveda \"Upkarma\" (therapy) bestowed to the society a great wealth of valuable plants and essential oils. Kumkumadi Tailam is a well-known Ayurvedic skincare product. It is said to be part of ancient beauty routines. And here, at Blue Nectar, we have kept up with these jewels of ayurvedic beauty and age-old beauty customs. Discover the magic of the ultimate Ayurvedic Kumkumadi Face Serum Valuable age-old formulations with several advantages for the skin abound in ancient Ayurvedic books. Many ayurvedic books have included kumkumadi oil in cosmetic treatments for dull skin. Ayurveda also notes the miraculous elixir of Face Oil as an anti-aging facial treatment. Rich herbs and natural oils abound in Kumkumadi Oil, a 100% classical ayurvedic composition. Combining the curative qualities of 26 Ayurvedic plants results in this most ancient concoction made meticulously. What is Kumkumadi Face Oil? Kumkumadi is an ancient name meaning Saffron and Adi. Mostly used in ancient skin treatments, it is the Ayurvedic mix of primordial herbs. It is also known as Saffron oil Kumkumadi oil is the greatest face oil for radiant and glowing skin since the old mash-up of herbs with the best of natural oils. The ayurvedic historical recipe of this face serum, sometimes called Kumkumadi Face Glow Oil, acts in two ways on your skin 1. Cleansing- Kumkumadi facial oil has cleansing powers like: removes facial impurities supports dark spots reduction minimizes wrinkles and fine lines fights pigmentation marks removes acne marks 2. Nourishing- Kumkumadi facial oil has following nourishing qualities: nourishes your skin inside natural Glow brightens complexion brightens dull skin refreshes the texture of your skin fades the appearance of aging Blue Nectar has one of the most valuable Ayurvedic recipes: kumkumadi tailam Known by most as kumkumadi face glow oil, the advantages include total skin healing to provide ideal, radiant skin from within Top Ingredients of Kumkumadi Tailam are- A treasure of 26 herbs, key ingredients in Kumkumadi Face Serum are: Saffron - Saffron is rich in skin brightening agents. Its medicinal and antioxidant properties re