 product has a shelf life of 3 years from the date of manufacturing. Please refer to the packaging for the exact expiry date. Faq Question5: What is the shelf life of this product?. Faq Content5: This is a completely natural Vitamin C and Hyaluronic Acid Face Serum. It contains extracts of Lemon and Amla (Indian Gooseberry), that are superfoods rich in Vitamin C and provide a natural skin glow without any harmful side effects. Faq Question5: What is the source of plant based vitamin C in the Vitamin C serum for face?. Faq Content4: Being a natural product, it is a deeply hydrating product and is suitable for all skin types. Even younger skin requires hydration, and the product is good for them too. It is the Best Face Serum for Glowing Skin. Faq Question4: Which skin type is Vitamin C serum for face used for?. Faq Question3: Is the pH of this serum suitable for active absorption without irritation?. Faq Content2: Yes, because the composition is balanced with antioxidant-rich herbs, it is less likely to produce photosensitivity than chemical-based Vitamin C serum. However, it is recommended that you pair it with sunscreen. Faq Question2: Can this serum be applied during the day without causing sun sensitivity?. Faq Content1: This serum includes an appropriate concentration of Vitamin C (between 10 and 20%), making it powerful enough to improve shine and collagen while being mild on all skin types for everyday usage. Faq Question1: What is the vitamin C content in this serum, and why is it suitable for everyday use?. Complete Ingredients Heading: Complete Ingredients List. Complete Ingredients: Ingredient Scientific Name Benefit Amla Phyllanthus emblica Brightens and lightens complexion Sunflower Oil Helianthus annuus Helps skin retain moisture so it becomes less dry Wheat Germ Oil Octacosanol It effectively treats dryness and dark spots Olive Oil Olea europaea L. Improved Skin Moisturization Lemon Oil Citrus limon Improves skin complexion & reduces dark spots Almond 