{"type":"response","data":{"products":[{"handle":"niacinamide-under-eye-serum-dark-circles","title":"Shubhr Niacinamide Under Eye Serum for Dark Circles (17 Herbs, 30ml)","description":"Blue Nectar's Plant-Based Niacinamide Under Eye Serum is a 100% Ayurvedic formulation designed to reduce dark circles, fine lines, and puffiness. Crafted with 17 potent Ayurvedic herbs, including Potato Starch and Papaya – natural sources of Niacinamide (Vitamin B3) – it helps to brighten and refresh the under-eye area. Niacinamide is known to improve skin tone and reduce puffiness, making the eyes look rested and youthful. Regular use of this gentle and lightweight serum revives tired under-eyes and restores a smoother and brighter look. Rated 5.0/5 (94 reviews). Use Product: The Ayurveda Lab ™- Papaya — Historically, Christopher Columbus referred to papaya as the \"fruit of the angels\" after observing its health benefits in America, marking an early sign of its global recognition as a healing and skin-friendly fruit. In Ayurveda, papaya, known as 'Erandakarkati', helps purify the blood and gently renew the skin through its natural enzymes. These qualities make it especially effective for reducing under-eye dark circles and puffiness. Why Blue: Science-Backed Benefits — Findings: A 2025 study evaluated the effectiveness of a papaya-based product on facial skin. Conducted as a clinical trial with 50 participants, the product was applied twice daily for 90 days. Results showed that 70% of users experienced a visible improvement in skin tone, a reduced appearance of dark spots, and a diminished appearance of fine lines. The study highlighted papaya's potential as a natural skincare ingredient. Journal- International Journal of Pharmacognosy and Pharmaceutical Sciences, 2025. Custom Tab Title: 5% Natural Papain and Niacin. Product Footer Description: Say Goodbye to Dark Circles and Puffiness with Blue Nectar's Plant-Based Under Eye Serum Let's talk under-eyes! Puffiness, hollowness, or under eye circles- Are you not of those rare people who do not experience these? The cause behind having dark under eye circles could either be discoloration issues or blood circulation issues. The other under eye condition is identified as under eye puffiness. The cause of this condition is the accumulation of lymph fluid under the eye area. The third condition that occurs under the eyes is called under eye hollowness when there emerges a hollow dent under the eyes, the area feels like there is a loss of volume and the skin there loses its plumpness. The cause behind this issue is the underuse of the muscle around the eyes- it becomes atrophied. There are several under-eye serums that can be incorporated in our skincare regime that help with the under eye problems that we mentioned above. These serums act as a shield against problems like dark circles, puffiness, hollowness, fine line around the eyes and dryness. Are you looking for a solution? We have carefully crafted our Blue Nectar's Shubhr Plant Based Niacinamide Under Eye Serum with Papaya & Potato Starch extracts to target your under eye problems, in the most effective way- A perfect under-eye serum. What makes it stand out? This serum uses plant-based ingredients like niacinamide, papaya, and potato starch and is free from harsh synthetic chemicals, greatly reducing the possibilities of any side effects. Niacinamide has skin-brightening properties. Niacinamide along with the natural enzymes in papaya is effective in reducing dark circles. Potato starch combats under eye puffiness, making your eyes look refreshed. This serum is simple and effective, providing a practical solution for tired-looking eyes. Forget about under-eye problems with Blue Nectar's best under-eye serum for dark circles and wrinkles a simple, nature's embrace for rejuvenating the eyes. Why Choose Lab Tested Niacinamide if you can have Plant Based Niacinamide Serum for Dark Circles with Blue Nectar? Plant-based remedies have been a tradi