{"type":"response","data":{"products":[{"handle":"kumkumadi-face-oil-serum-for-glowing-skin","title":"Kumkumadi Face Serum and Oil with Saffron for Glowing Skin (26 herbs)","description":"Kumkumadi Face Serum for glowing skin is 100% Ayurvedic. Made from 26 herbs, this face serum is clinically proven to brighten skin in 28 days , reduce pigmentation, and fight signs of aging. This face serum, which is also a face oil, is free from any chemicals or preservatives and contains saffron that helps boost skin collagen, keeping the skin youthful and plump. Rated 4.9/5 (2142 reviews). Why Blue: Science Backed Benefits — Findings: A 2014 study found that saffron significantly reduces pigmentation and skin redness. The research involved 100 participants aged 25-55. At the conclusion of the study, 75% of participants in the saffron group reported a noticeable improvement in skin tone and a decrease in redness. Journal- Tropical Journal of Pharmaceutical Research, 2014. Use Product: The Ayurveda Lab ™ - Kumkumadi Oil — 'Kumkumadi' means 'saffron'. Kumkumadi is said to be created by twin gods – Ashwini Kumaras – also known as the royal physicians of God. They are supposed to bring royal herbs and medicines from heaven to earth to help mankind. Kumkumadi Tailam is one such formulation made by them. Blue: Ingredients Transparency — All Herbs declared on products in form of Herb Quotient; With more than 150 quality herbs, our products have High Herb Quotient; Free From Harmful Chemicals — All our products are free from harmful chemicals & mineral oils. Product Footer Description: Kumkumadi Face Serum: Ayurveda's Best-Kept Treasure India has led the way in natural, organic, chemical-free, and cruelty-free skincare products. This is important as the world is now paying attention to these products. We owe it to Indian ayurveda. Ayurveda \"Upkarma\" (therapy) bestowed to the society a great wealth of valuable plants and essential oils. Kumkumadi Tailam is a well-known Ayurvedic skincare product. It is said to be part of ancient beauty routines. And here, at Blue Nectar, we have kept up with these jewels of ayurvedic beauty and age-old beauty customs. Discover the magic of the ultimate Ayurvedic Kumkumadi Face Serum Valuable age-old formulations with several advantages for the skin abound in ancient Ayurvedic books. Many ayurvedic books have included kumkumadi oil in cosmetic treatments for dull skin. Ayurveda also notes the miraculous elixir of Face Oil as an anti-aging facial treatment. Rich herbs and natural oils abound in Kumkumadi Oil, a 100% classical ayurvedic composition. Combining the curative qualities of 26 Ayurvedic plants results in this most ancient concoction made meticulously. What is Kumkumadi Face Oil? Kumkumadi is an ancient name meaning Saffron and Adi. Mostly used in ancient skin treatments, it is the Ayurvedic mix of primordial herbs. It is also known as Saffron oil Kumkumadi oil is the greatest face oil for radiant and glowing skin since the old mash-up of herbs with the best of natural oils. The ayurvedic historical recipe of this face serum, sometimes called Kumkumadi Face Glow Oil, acts in two ways on your skin 1. Cleansing- Kumkumadi facial oil has cleansing powers like: removes facial impurities supports dark spots reduction minimizes wrinkles and fine lines fights pigmentation marks removes acne marks 2. Nourishing- Kumkumadi facial oil has following nourishing qualities: nourishes your skin inside natural Glow brightens complexion brightens dull skin refreshes the texture of your skin fades the appearance of aging Blue Nectar has one of the most valuable Ayurvedic recipes: kumkumadi tailam Known by most as kumkumadi face glow oil, the advantages include total skin healing to provide ideal, radiant skin from within Top Ingredients of Kumkumadi Tailam are- A treasure of 26 herbs, key ingredients in Kumkumadi Face Serum are: Saffron - Saffron is rich in skin brightening agents. Its medicinal and antioxidant properties remove dead cells and give glow to the skin, thus making kumkumadi face serum the most appropriate skin brightening oil. Kumkumadi Face Oil is also known as Saffron oil due to abundant presence of Saffron Sandalwood - This helps to lighten skin. Sandalwood's anti-aging qualities explain the shine and nourishment attained from using it. The enlarged pores show a clear decrease; sandalwood also helps to prevent skin darkening. Sandalwood has anti-aging and anti-inflammatory qualities; hence Kumkumadi face serum is the greatest anti-aging face serum available. Laksa - Its antibacterial property magically heals the skin infection. Laksa with its medicinal properties provides an internal repair of the skin. Lodhra - Lodhra is a very strong herb and helps to detoxify blood and clear dark spots and blemishes from your skin. It reduces scars, pigmentations, and fine lines on your face. Lodhra supports the process of anti-aging and combats wrinkles. Manjistha - Manjistha extracts are rich in anti-bacterial and anti-inflammatory, with cooling properties on acne-prone skin. It is effective for hyperpigmentation and a great skin whitening agent. Hence, Kumkumadi oil containing Manjistha is a good face serum for skin whitening in women and men. Nagkesar - Nagkesar is a medication that prevents any type of skin infection. It removes acne scars and black spots. You can use Nagkesar as an active ingredient to achieve even Skin tone. Kumkumadi tailam can be used as a safe face serum for acne prone skin. Mulethi - Mulethi is used to repair skin pigment and stop sun damage to it. Mulethi extractions abound in skin-brightening and whitening agents. It improves blood flow toward your skin and helps reduce skin scars as well. All these ingredients make Kumkumadi face serum the best face serum for glowing skin, free of scars, acne, pigmentation and dark spots. But what makes Kumkumadi Face Serum truly unique is how it draws upon the ancient Ayurvedic understanding that beauty is multidimensional. According to the Ayurvedic tradition, true beauty stems from three pillars: ,Roopam (Outer Beauty): Expressed through radiant skin, lustrous hair, and a healthy body. The blend of herbs in Kumkumadi Face Serumlike saffron, sandalwood, and manjisthawork together to visibly enhance the skin, revealing brightness and clarity. ,Gunam (Inner Beauty): Rooted in the purity and nobility of character. While a serum can't bottle virtue, using ingredients that purify and heal, like lodhra and laksa, helps support the skin's natural vitality, allowing your inner glow to shine through. ,Vayas. Custom Tab Title: Clinical Study Results: 100% Felt Brighter Skin | 97% Saw Reduced Wrinkles & Dark Spots. Blue Nector Title: Why Blue Nectar?. Ingredients Title: Plant Based Ingredients. Benefits Title: Key Benefits. Description Title: Know your Product. Faqs: Q: I want fair skin is this good product.? A: If you are looking for some miracle..then you would be disappointed. It's a good not sticky oil for facial massage. I have used it only for a month, can't vouch for fairness but skin feels soft and good. Q: How long does it take to clear face pigmentation? A: 6-8 weeks depending on the intensity of pigmentation Q: Can I use an almond oil and aloe moisturizer after applying this serum on the skin A: Kumkumadi Serum is a moisturizer in itself. Ideally you should not be mixing so many moisturisers and oils at the same time. It will be better to use Almond Oil at a different time than the time of use of Kumkumadi. If you have dry skin, you may use herbal aloe vera moisturiser after applying Kumkumadi. Q: Which one is good Kama Ayurvedic Kumkumadi Oil or this Blue Nectar Kumkumadi Face Serum? A: As a representative of Blue Nectar, we would not be able to comment on Kama Ayurvedic Kumkumadi. Blue Nectar Kumkumadi is based on a classical ayurvedic formulation that consists of authentic sandalwood oil and saffron apart from other vital herbs. Our products have been receiving great reviews